(window.StoryDialogue = window.StoryDialogue || {})["ev-7"] = {"560901101":[["","A.D. 2054, Pacific Ocean, a secret laboratory on a desert island..."],["Madland","Three, two, one..."],["Madland","Detonate."],["","As the countdown reaches zero, the explosive devices placed outside the laboratory's protective door are activated simultaneously. With a thunderous roar, the massive panel is torn into pieces of scrap metal."],["","The lab guards rush over as if woken from a deep sleep, but before they can pull the control levers, gunfire pours out from the smoke, hitting their mechs with precision."],["","The clamor that ensues ends within minutes, leaving a dead silence in its wake."],["Madland","Freg, talk to me."],["Fregata","Sentries, covert guards, patrols—all taken care of... except a few cowards who ran at the first blast."],["Fregata","Do you need me to chase them down?"],["Madland","No. Let the small fry scatter. We came for one thing—Zeke Steel's head."],["Madland","Stay sharp, Freg— don't rush in. First, confirm if there are any other anomalies in the vicinity."],["Fregata","Oh? Since when did you get so fussy?"],["Fregata","This isn't like you at all, Madland."],["Madland","Don't forget—this isn't some dime-store lab. It's Zeke Steel's den."],["Madland","He's crazy, not stupid. He won't just lay his guts out on the floor."],["Madland","Knowing him, by the time we swaggered in, he'd already done the math. He's probably kicking back with some popcorn as we walk right into his trap."],["Madland","Bernini and Cosette... already paid for my mistakes. I won't... let it happen again."],["Fregata","Spare me the sermon... I'm not the one who needs looking after."],["Fregata","Zeke Steel owes me blood too... I won't die until I collect."],["","And so, the two of them, one after the other, silently walk into the laboratory."],["","But the journey is surprisingly calm. Too quiet. No ambushes, no traps—like a guided tour straight to the core."],["","...Until they reach the heart of the facility and are confronted by a mech, its frame polished to a mirror shine."],["Fregata","Is this... an AWT? He built a whole desert island lab just to stash this?"],["Madland","Looks like a Gen 1.5 AWT... Barely any signs of wear. Smooth, unblemished, like a polished mirror. It's almost like a silhouette... a shadow..."],["???","You have a keen eye, Mr. Guan Yiwen. With just a glance, you saw the essence of the \"Shadowrabbit.\""],["Fregata","Zeke Steel!"],["","Without hesitation, almost the moment she sees his figure clearly enough, Fregata instinctively pulls the trigger."],["","But the bullet passes straight through Zeke's body, like a stone thrown at a reflection in the water, rippling and then returning to its original state."],["Madland","Put the gun down, Fregata—it's just a remote projection."],["Fregata","Tch. Coward won't even show his face."],["Zeke's Projection","Oh we'll meet—just not yet... Showdowns between protagonists and antagonists are always more interesting at the climax, are they not?"],["Zeke's Projection","Besides, my experiment has reached its most critical stage. Even if I wanted to have a heart-to-heart with you, I really can't spare the time."],["Zeke's Projection","By the way, where's your little blue-haired sidekick? Why didn't she come along?"],["Zeke's Projection","Cosette, wasn't it...? Still grieving her lost friend?"],["Madland","...Don't you dare say that name!"],["Zeke's Projection","Come now, Mr. Guan. There's no need for that."],["Zeke's Projection","Loss and parting are inevitable elements of life. You have to overcome them to grow. I just gave her the last lesson in advance... Really you should be thanking me."],["Madland","Zeke Steel... I'm going to kill you!"],["Fregata","Madland, why bother wasting words on someone who won't even show himself?"],["Fregata","He loves riddles and experiments? Don't dance to his tune. Level the lab—don't leave him any research data!"],["","Before these words land, bullets rain down upon the AWT in the center of the room."],["","But what follows is not the sound of metal clashing, but an eerie noise, like the world being torn apart."],["","After being hit, the AWT refracts a black light, seemingly activated and projected across the entire room."],["Fregata","What the—?!"],["Zeke's Projection","You're good at getting to the crux of the matter, aren't you, Miss Fregata? But you got one crucial part wrong. That is—you are also part of this experiment."],["Zeke's Projection","The so-called intelligence and clues you dug up were essentially bait I deliberately provided to lure you in."],["Fregata","You bastard!"],["Madland","Freg! Get out of here, now... The space beneath us is warping! That \"Shadowrabbit\"... it's doing this?"],["Fregata","If I could move, I would!"],["","The black light swirls like a vortex in the deep sea, pulling the two toward the bottomless darkness."],["","At the same time, at the Ashes' base..."],["Chloe","Marcus, the recent string of anomalies... well, there's a new development—this is a report from the frontline reconnaissance team."],["Marcus","Ah, here we go again... It's that unknown ST squad again, right?"],["Chloe","That's right... it's them. These unknown ST units, as soon as they encounter our reconnaissance teams, they attack without hesitation..."],["Chloe","By the time everyone reacts and pursues, they disappear without a trace..."],["Marcus","First, they use spoof signals to probe the outposts outside the base, then they launch unprovoked attacks on our supply teams... Now they won't even give recon a break?"],["Marcus","That damned squad... they make a mess and scrub every trace, every time!"],["Chloe","...All we're left with are flimsy sightings and hearsay."],["Marcus","Let's take a break. We've had more than our fair share of bizarre incidents for one month..."],["Chloe","No, this one's different—we can't afford to delay."],["Chloe","You see... our scouts saw Blair himself among that ST unit."],["Marcus","What?!"],["","Marcus shakes off his fatigue and immediately snaps awake."],["","With a serious expression, he takes the report from Chloe's hand and spreads out the sheets of paper along with the accompanying photos."],["Marcus","That's... Blair Bluecher—and his puffed-up guard!"],["Marcus","No, that's impossible... Blair died in that incident! I saw it with my own eyes!"],["Chloe","Could it be... someone is impersonating Blair, trying to use his name to rally remnant forces?"],["Marcus","But the ST battalion in the photo looks brand new... If it's just an act, that's one hell of a performance."],["Chloe","Or perhaps... a UNCS mole was covering him—helped him fake the death and slip out?"],["Marcus","Kaidan and Raven are solid. I don't buy them doing that."],["Chloe","But... our reconnaissance team has no reason to fabricate such a report. They did see Blair."],["","For a moment, the scene falls into silence. It isn't until much later that Marcus breaks it."],["Marcus","No—this wasn't forged. There's a rotten scheme behind this."],["Marcus","There's a gang calling themselves the \"UNCS Revival Front\" drifting around lately, harassing our depots again and again."],["Marcus","I initially thought they were just a band of robbers under the guise of the NDF... Now it seems their activities are likely more than just that."],["","At this, Marcus's fists clenched involuntarily, his teeth gritting as he stared at the photo of the former governor."],["Marcus","Blair, oh Blair... you were a shameless executioner in life, and now you're haunting us in death!"],["Marcus","No way! We can't just let this go... Whether truly dead or faking it, we can't let the name \"Blair\" terrorize this island again!"],["Marcus","I'll rally the Ashes and begin an investigation. Chloe, follow up on the Revival Front angle."],["Chloe","Don't worry, I'll make sure to get to the bottom of this."],["","Finally a crack appears in the bottomless chaos. In a daze, a familiar figure flickers faintly before their eyes."],["Cosette","......"],["Fregata","Wait, is that... Cosette?!"],["","Unlike the girl in her memory who always wore a smile, Cosette now only wears confusion and fatigue on her face."],["Cosette","...Fregata."],["Fregata","Cosette, what are you doing here?! It's dangerous, you need to... ugh!"],["","But just as Fregata reaches out, everything in front of her collapses, as if she is awakening from a dream."],["","Fighting off the dizziness, she forces her eyes open. What lies before her, however, is a strange and desolate forest."],["Fregata","Tch... Was all of that just a dream...?"],["Fregata","Damn it, wasn't I just in that bastard's laboratory?"],["Fregata","...What's happening?!"]],"560901301":[["Chloe","It should be safe here. Let's sit down and talk, Miss Anonymous..."],["","But she doesn't come any closer. Instead she steps back and places her hand on her pistol."],["Fregata","No—there are a few things I need to confirm first."],["Fregata","If I'm not mistaken, this is our first meeting. If it were me, I wouldn't call in fire support for a complete stranger."],["Chloe","P-Please believe me... I'm not your enemy."],["Fregata","Nor am I your friend."],["","As soon as the words are spoken, Fregata has already drawn the pistol from her waist and swiftly disengaged the safety."],["Fregata","Who are you? Which organization do you belong to? Why are you helping me? Stand right there and tell me everything."],["Fregata","I'll give you ten seconds."],["Chloe","Wait, d-don't get excited..."],["Fregata","Ten, nine, eight—"],["Chloe","I-I'm Chloe Schmidt! Medic and leader of the Ashes logistics crew. The reason I offered my help... is because..."],["","But before Chloe can finish, Fregata's face darkens. She raises her pistol, the black muzzle aimed directly at her."],["Chloe","No, don't shoot! Please believe me, I mean no harm!"],["Chloe","To avoid friendly fire from their support, I spent almost five minutes calculating coordinates... It's true!"],["","The muzzle roars, the bullet leaves the chamber."],["","But... the pain Chloe anticipates never comes. Instead, a pained wail echoes from behind her."],["Revival Front Soldier","I was... so close..."],["Chloe","That's a... a soldier of the Revival Front!"],["Chloe","Was he following us all along?"],["","After checking every blind spot to ensure no enemies remain, Fregata finally holsters her weapon."],["Fregata","Alright, it should be safe now."],["Fregata","Sorry—if I hadn't done that, that sneaky bastard wouldn't have taken the bait... My apologies for making you play along with that little act."],["Fregata","My name is Fregata Oasis, but you can just call me Fregata. I suppose you could say I'm a mercenary."],["Fregata","I think we can have a proper conversation now—Miss Chloe of \"The Ashes.\""],["Fregata","So... you're not actually fighting this UNCS or whatever it's called; the real enemy is the Revival Front operating under Blair's banner?"],["","From the laboratory to Milkhama, from the mad scientist to the former governor, the two recount their respective experiences."],["Chloe","Yes, that's exactly it."],["Chloe","Actually... the reason I lent a hand just now was because I saw you fighting the Revival Front and assumed you were someone being hunted who knew something..."],["Chloe","I never imagined your real identity would be something so... extraordinary. Just to think, a visitor from another world..."],["Fregata","Nothing special—just like you, piloting mechs in rebellion and burning the big shots' conspiracies and ambitions to ashes. Given how things stand now, even I can hardly believe it..."],["Chloe","So, Miss Fregata, what are your plans now? Will you continue pursuing that scientist guy, Zeke?"],["Chloe","According to what you said, he's very likely hiding on Milkhama... It also seems connected to the recent anomalies here."],["Fregata","That guy's dangerous—we can't let him get away."],["Fregata","But I'm no good at investigations or chasing people down... First, I need to find my friend."],["Chloe","Oh, that gentleman named \"Madland,\" right?"],["Chloe","Do you have any other information besides the name? Maybe we can help find him..."],["Fregata","Unfortunately, that's all we have to go on. A single vague clue."],["Fregata","After arriving here, all my equipment was trashed—nothing left at all."],["Chloe","In that case... I'm afraid we'll have to ask that people-finder from Harpy..."],["Chloe","She might know a way."]],"560902101":[["","His consciousness is hazy. No matter how he struggles, he can't escape the darkness. His mind is like a lost ship adrift, rocking to and fro, battered by the waves."],["","Wake up..."],["","This isn't the first time Madland has tasted this feeling. He experienced it on that beach, a despair that only comes after days of scorching sun, body consumed by hunger and thirst."],["","Open your eyes... Don't just fall asleep like this..."],["","The voice by his ear starts to become clearer."],["","And then, he remembers."],["","It was the same back then, at the brink of death, he heard this bitter yet sincere voice."],["Cosette","Please wake up... Boss!"],["Madland","What... what happened?"],["Madland","Where's Fregata, and that bastard Zeke... What is this place...?"],["","Allies and enemies alike, all gone—the scene has shifted from a laboratory to unfamiliar ruins—but even that doesn't answer all of Madland's questions."],["Madland","No, Cosette, why are you here...? Aren't you supposed to be in the hospital?"],["Cosette","Zeke... the hospital... was it the time point when... Bernini was murdered..."],["Madland","Time point? Cosette, what are you talking about?"],["Madland","Your injuries aren't healed yet. This isn't the time to act tough, we need to—ah!"],["","The loud sound of a building collapsing interrupts Madland's lecture."],["","He looks toward the sound. On this desolate ground, several pitch-black STs have surfaced from who knows where."],["","They trample and rampage through the forest, fighting and opening fire on each other as if no one else exists."],["Madland","When did these sneak up on us? Are they Zeke Steel's minions?"],["Cosette","Boss, this is bad. We're currently caught in the crossfire!"],["Cosette","I'll explain the details to you later, but for now..."],["Madland","Yeah, now isn't the time to chat. Whatever the case, we need to move first."],["Madland","Cosette, use the ridge and the treeline for cover, avoid their firing points—let's head for twelve o'clock!"],["Cosette","Understood, Boss!"],["Mary","This is Mary from the UNCS Special Investigation Unit. I've arrived at the location where the \"Unknown ST Squad\" was detected. The investigation has been completed."],["Mary","Aside from multiple locations in the city showing signs of activated arashi matter, I've found no trace of STs, and no mirage like the one described in the report."],["Mary","I repeat, I have arrived at the target location and have not discovered any anomalies."],["Natalia","Please continue with the mission, Captain Mary... and stay alert."],["Natalia","Based on frontline reports, there's a sixty percent chance you'll make direct contact with these unidentified STs, and a thirty percent chance of a sudden attack."],["Mary","Hmph. So even the GSA has its moments of uncertainty."],["Mary","You intel folks... can't you figure things out before ordering us around?"],["Natalia","Captain Mary, there's a reason I'm warning you... The investigation teams we sent to the other areas—we lost contact with them."],["Natalia","These mysterious incidents are not without cause. Being careless could lead to significant losses..."],["Mary","I'd sooner believe it's a recon unit misjudgment than some \"mysterious incident.\""],["Mary","Have you read their battle reports? These so-called mysterious STs can bypass heat detection and block electromagnetic scans. They can launch surprise attacks without warning and disappear without a trace."],["Mary","What kind of fairy tale is this? Putting aside the technology, there isn't a single unit out there that could pull off that kind of flawless execution."],["Natalia","Captain Mary, people make mistakes—but bullet holes don't lie."],["Natalia","After receiving these reports, we carefully examined the attacked STs... The hits were lethal and precise, something only a well-trained unit could achieve."],["Natalia","On Milkhama, finding a unit like that isn't easy... aside from the DLAF across the Foren River, that leaves only our brave NDF."],["Mary","So, do you think this unidentified ST unit is related to the NDF?"],["Natalia","Naturally. With Goman missing, plenty of former NDF hands are at odds with the authorities and itching to make a splash."],["Natalia","As the situation between east and west Milkhama becomes increasingly tense, any potential threat to the UNCS must be dealt with... wouldn't you agree?"],["Mary","I was wondering before why the GSA deliberately bypassed the NDF elite and chose me to carry out the mission."],["Mary","In the end, it's just down to your tedious political games."],["Natalia","No need to make it sound ugly. I prefer to call it... prudence."],["Natalia","Figure out who's in charge, and your future path will be smoother."],["Mary","......"],["","As Mary hesitates, a sudden burst of intense gunfire erupts nearby."],["Mary","Wait... What's that sound?"],["","Almost the moment the shelling ceases, two STs with indistinguishable numbers flash past from both sides of the road."],["Mary","Fast—very fast. These must be the rumored unknown STs, right?"],["Mary","Perfect. Let me see for myself who you really are."]],"560902301":[["","Although mentally prepared, Madland still feels an indescribable sense of oppression when actually stepping into the room."],["","He finds himself in a bare, dimly-lit chamber, devoid of decoration. In the center lies a simple wooden table, while the interrogators' chairs line the walls on three sides. The chairs are occupied—and the interrogators appear to have been waiting for some time."],["","Six, or nine? Madland cannot remember exactly how many people are there in front of him, only silently following the process of \"question, answer, repeat.\""],["","...Rather than an identity registration, it feels more like a prisoner interrogation."],["","After the long interrogation, the recorders leave one by one. In their place, a female figure appears."],["Natalia","Mr. Madland, Miss Cosette, I apologize to you... I appreciate your patience and cooperation."],["Natalia","From now on, the General Security Administration will directly handle all your affairs. There will be no more cumbersome procedures and reviews."],["Madland","Oh? Compared to those rigid interrogators, you seem remarkably reasonable."],["Natalia","After all... this isn't my first time handling such matters."],["Natalia","That said, your willingness to cooperate suggests you have your own motives, correct?"],["Cosette","Yes. As we said during questioning, we're here because of Zeke Steel... If we want to return to our world, we have to find him."],["Cosette","We're new here and know no one. Without local help, even gathering intel and supplies for the investigation is a problem..."],["Natalia","So, you reached out to the NDF through Captain Mary? That was indeed a wise decision."],["Natalia","...But unfortunately, the increasing number of anomalies has kept us extremely busy, leaving us no time to assist you."],["Cosette","Anomalies?"],["Natalia","Uh-huh, or rather... the STs you and Captain Mary encountered earlier."],["Natalia","Some also call them illusions, shadows, or mirages... Generally speaking, they are unknown STs that suddenly appear, cause a commotion, and then disappear."],["Natalia","We have collected data from dozens of sites and finally found a commonality... Traces of artificially created arashi matter fields were captured at each incident site."],["Natalia","However, scientists at the Institute of Technology have tried many methods and still cannot theoretically explain these phenomena, only saying... it may originate from some type of undisclosed mysterious technology."],["Madland","Then perhaps we should change our approach... Maybe we're after the same target?"],["Natalia","Where should we start with this?"],["Madland","I don't think there's anything mysterious about technology. Theoretical construction, development planning, application implementation... No technology can come out of thin air—they always leave traces."],["Madland","Unless the owner of the technology is a deus ex machina, like... us, coming from another world."],["Natalia","You mean... that Zeke is not only your enemy but also the mastermind behind this series of anomalies?"],["Madland","...Correct."],["Madland","I've dealt with him plenty. He's ruthless and reckless—calling him a madman would be giving him too much credit."],["Madland","I have reason to believe he has already turned your world into a playground for his experiments."],["Madland","The anomalies you see... are the results of his experiments."],["Mary","But these are just your conjectures—a one-sided statement cannot form a lead."],["Natalia","No, sometimes intuition is the best lead."],["Natalia","Moreover, Mr. Madland, as you have been honest with us, we should certainly show more sincerity."],["","Just as he finishes speaking, Madland's communication terminal receives an encrypted message."],["Madland","Is this... a coordinate?"],["Natalia","In fact, not long ago, the Institute of Technology detected traces of a man-made arashi matter field in another area."],["Natalia","If, as you say, the anomalies are related to this Zeke... then you might be able to catch him slipping up here, right?"],["Madland","Not bad... I'll take it."],["Natalia","However, I have one more condition—since you're going to investigate, take Captain Mary with you."],["Natalia","Considering that both of you are new to Milkhama and there are many things you don't fully understand, having a guide with you will make things much more convenient."],["Madland","A guide... I'd say it's more like surveillance, right?"],["Natalia","Good cooperation often requires some necessary constraints... After all, you are armed personnel with STs, so we naturally have some concerns."],["Natalia","In any case... I wish you a pleasant journey ahead."]],"560991101":[["","Professor Zeke, this isn't what you promised!"],["","You promised that no one would interfere with our plan."],["","And now, not only have three people from your world arrived on Milkhama, but they're using your \"Shadowrabbit\" exactly as designed!"],["","Is this also part of your grand plan?"],["Zeke","Of course not, that AWT is just a byproduct of the experiment."],["Zeke","In research, you win some, you lose some. If they took it, they took it. It doesn't affect our plan."],["Zeke","I'm more curious as to why there's an extra person with them... Could it be that someone from another time and space responded to this ND transformation?"],["","You say it like it's nothing! You know, because of your negligence, the Revival Front lost half a battalion!"],["Zeke","And? They're just tools. Broken is broken. Look on the bright side—out with the old, in with the new."],["Zeke","No need to be so bitter, our plan is still progressing smoothly, and your long-held wish will soon be fulfilled!"],["Zeke","...Or are you dissatisfied with the results of our collaboration?"],["","Zeke sneers as he speaks. To the one he is addressing, it is unclear how much of it is mockery, and how much is threat."],["","After a long standoff, the visitor finally suppresses their anger and lowers their tone."],["","Professor Zeke, I have never doubted your skills. Whether in theory or application, you're far ahead of your time."],["","But that's precisely why the mistakes you make seem too elementary. It's as though..."],["","You were deliberately guiding them to Milkhama."],["","Zeke frowns slightly, but soon returns to his squinting, cold smile."],["Zeke","Haha, you must be joking... That group hates me to the core, even if they have to cross time and space to skin me alive, they'd do it."],["Zeke","If you're really worried, just send more people to wipe out the loose ends... You have my wholehearted support."],["","That goes without saying."],["","What I'm actually concerned about... is that you're hiding something, Professor Zeke."],["Zeke","Hiding something? Haven't I already told you? I came here just to verify the potential of the \"BIRD/BINARY System.\""],["Zeke","You provide the venue, I provide the technology, and you can use all the research results as you wish... There's no more generous and selfless research agreement than that, yes?"],["Zeke","I really don't understand. We're about to destroy the world, and you're still hung up on trivialities."],["","...!"],["Security Chief","What we're doing now... is destroying this city!"],["Security Chief","You should know very well that these statements are mere self-deception. At this magnitude, safety is out of the question!"],["Security Chief","Once the explosives trigger a chain reaction, not only the army in the outer city but also the citizens in the residential area will be unable to escape disaster."],["","......"],["","The man in black shakes his head, brushing away the memories circling in his mind."],["","Professor Zeke, I'll say it again... What we're doing is not destroying the world, but saving that city."],["Zeke","Fine, fine. Call it what you like."],["Zeke","To me, there's no such distinction."],["","Outside Beloren City, Suburban Ruins"],["","The desolate land is like a silent grave, quietly recording the past glory and dreams of this city."],["","Walking through the ruins and into the outer city, the old man arrived long ago, quietly standing in front of the tombstone."],["Celine","Sorry to keep you waiting, Dr. Lando."],["Lando","It's alright, I came early."],["Lando","I haven't seen your father in a long time, and the thought of having a chance to catch up got me out the door ahead of time."],["Celine","Dr. Lando... you still can't let go of the past?"],["Lando","Yes. That war buried not only the city of Beloren but also thousands of families and futures."],["Lando","Sometimes, when I close my eyes, I return to the time before the war came."],["Lando","I really wish I could stay there forever, sipping my wife's coffee, driving my daughter to school..."],["Lando","Looking back, even the days of arguing with your father feel precious."],["Lando","And now, everything has turned to dust... If only I had been calmer back then..."],["Celine","You don't need to blame yourself, Dr. Lando."],["Celine","In that situation, even as Chief Researcher of the Beloren Experiment Center, you couldn't have prevented the war from coming."],["Celine","The real culprits are the DLAF who stormed the city and the NDF who took civilians as hostages..."],["","The old man doesn't answer, but instead gives a bitter smile."],["","He bends down, pulls away the weeds growing in front of the monument, and gently places the white flowers he holds in front of it."],["Lando","Celine, if you have time, come and visit your father more often..."],["Lando","You have a long life ahead, there's no need to hold a grudge against him."],["Celine","No, I never resented him, I just... felt sorry for him."],["Celine","He was an excellent soldier, rushing to the battlefield when the enemy approached, dutifully fulfilling his responsibilities... until the very last moment."],["","The girl's fingers gently touch the cold tombstone, as if recalling a past she is reluctant to confront."],["Celine","...But he was a rotten father."],["Lando","Celine, you misunderstand... Although your father was a member of the NDF, he never wavered in his love for you."],["Lando","Faced with the duties of a security chief and the responsibilities of family, he did everything he could—this, I know better than you."],["Celine","Then when the DLAF broke through Beloren, and my mother and I were desperately hiding at home, where was he?"],["Celine","When the fires spread—when my mother was trapped beneath the rubble that night... where was he?!"],["Lando","......"],["Celine","If the blast hadn't spared my neighborhood, if you hadn't found me in the ruins, Dr. Lando... I'd likely be sleeping in this soil too."],["Celine","He gave everything for the UNCS, but in the end, all that's left is this solitary tombstone..."],["Lando","Child, you don't understand... your father was just protecting you in his own way."],["","The old man sighs and looks toward the desolate city district in the distance. In his eyes, there is both nostalgia and regret."],["Lando","Let's not talk about this anymore. Let's put the memories of the past aside for now."],["Lando","Celine, you specifically invited me here, so it must be more than just reminiscing you're after."],["Lando","So... is there new business once again?"],["Celine","Yes, over at the Ashes, a special guest has arrived..."]],"560903101":[["Fregata","So, Chloe—she's the \"people-finder\" you mentioned earlier?"],["Chloe","That's right, Celine is an old friend of ours. She helped us a lot back when Blair was in power."],["Celine","No, no, no, I should be thanking you for keeping my business running."],["","Fregata's gaze sweeps over the girl in front of her. In truth, if Chloe hadn't told her, she'd never have connected this person with the role of a \"liaison.\""],["","Her only feature was having no features—perhaps that's the first impression her plain attire left on Fregata."],["Fregata","Your sense of style reminds me of someone I once knew."],["Celine","Ahem... Pretense is also part of intelligence work. A true liaison hides in the crowd."],["Celine","But considering this is the first time I'm meeting our guest, I should properly introduce myself."],["","The girl walks up to Fregata and respectfully presents her business card."],["Celine","I am Celine Reynolds, Harpy Guild liaison. Just call me Celine."],["Fregata","A guild? So, can you also help find people?"],["Celine","Please do not underestimate Harpy."],["Celine","From open weapon tenders and mercenary brokerage to the shadowy side—black market deals, ST smuggling—and even ST salvage and weapons repair... we do it all."],["Celine","In short, anything that official institutions are too embarrassed to do is part of our business operations."],["Celine","Locating specific individuals is very much within our scope."],["Celine","Even if it's just a name, a photo, or a rumor, we can help you find the corresponding person."],["Fregata","Okay, I get it... just like Madland's Donau Film Group—nice sign out front, different business in back."],["Celine","...Please."],["Celine","If you continue to disrespect my work, I'll have to cancel your first-time discount."],["Chloe","N-No, sorry, Miss Fregata was just joking to lighten the mood, please don't mind her..."],["Celine","Never mind, it's your first time here, so some apprehension is expected."],["Celine","Let's skip the pleasantries and get straight to business."],["","Celine walks back to the car and gently taps on the window as if giving a secret signal."],["","Once the whispered words fade, the car door slowly opens, and an elderly man steps out to face the group."],["Chloe","This is... Dr. Lando?!"],["Chloe","Celine, weren't we hired to find someone for Miss Fregata? How did you bring in a big name like Dr. Lando?"],["Lando","Young lady, you flatter me. After the incident in Beloren City, I'm just an old man who has stepped back from the front lines."],["Chloe","You're too modest. The medical equipment and diagnostic modules you invested in back then practically pioneered the field of ST emergency care, saving countless pilots' lives..."],["Chloe","Moreover, a scientist of your esteemed stature appearing so suddenly in the Ashes' camp..."],["Chloe","Won't the UNCS take issue?"],["Celine","You don't need to worry about that. Intelligence work has always been a strength of Harpy's... Besides, Dr. Lando has actually been in contact with you for a while."],["Chloe","But as far as I recall, this is our first meeting with Dr. Lando..."],["Celine","Hmm... It was probably when Governor Blair was still in office, right? That time when your ground forces were trapped in the canyon by the NDF."],["Celine","But why... would Dr. Lando take such a big risk to help us? At that time, if Blair had found any proof..."],["Chloe","So that's it! Dr. Lando was the mystery informant... but why risk so much to help us?"],["Celine","Because the doctor, like me, is a victim of the Beloren tragedy... The Blair authorities committed irreversible wrongs against us."],["Celine","That's not what we're here for... This time, the doctor stepped out from behind the curtain, not because of these past events, but to see this guest."],["Fregata","Came to see me...?"],["Lando","That's right, the purpose of my visit is to meet you, the rumored \"visitor from another world.\""],["Lando","I may be semi-retired, but after half a lifetime in research... hearing something this rare makes it hard not to see it firsthand."],["Fregata","Sorry... *places her hand on her knife*If you're thinking of tying me up for some scientific experiment, you'd better think twice..."],["Lando","Haha, don't worry, I'm just here for a meeting, no experiments involved."],["Lando","Celine has told me about your general situation... Regarding your missing companion, the UNCS already has some leads."],["Fregata","Is that so... Not even a day, and Madland's probably caused a stir already? Sounds like him."],["Lando","It's probably just a coincidence. Due to the recent frequent anomalies, the UNCS has been closely monitoring traces of arashi matter."],["Lando","And today, their detectors have successively detected signs of arashi matter fields being artificially activated in two areas."],["Lando","So, they dispatched two investigation teams to each location. One was where Miss Fregata appeared, and the other... I suppose it's where your companion was."],["Fregata","Oh? Well, I didn't get to meet the UNCS at all—ran into a group calling themselves the Revival Front instead."],["Lando","Then you better hurry... I'm afraid there's an insider within the UNCS who must have tipped them off."],["Fregata","Tch, one problem after another... Give me the coordinates, I'm heading out right away."]],"560903301":[["Revival Front Soldier","Report, Captain—we swept the tower to the east and the street to the west... no sign of the targets."],["Revival Front Captain","Cunning rats... the moment they hit the city, they vanish!"],["Revival Front Captain","If we can't find them, so be it. The professor has assigned us a new task. Let's tidy up and head to the city."],["Revival Front Soldier","Got it!"],["","And just like that, the Revival Front's search ends in a rush—none of them realizing their targets are tucked into the crumbling ruins right behind them."],["Fregata","Sure you're just an intel broker? You actually found a hiding spot right under their noses."],["Celine","Beloren is my hometown after all... Little tricks like this are nothing."],["Fregata","By the way, who exactly are these people calling themselves the Revival Front?"],["Fregata","I heard you guys say that this group is loyal to that Blair... but isn't he already six feet under?"],["Chloe","No. It'd be more accurate to say... they serve the war."],["Chloe","You see, Milkhama went through a brutal border war. The NDF seized the upper hand and took control."],["Chloe","Then a catastrophic incident threw the UNCS into an international firestorm... the NDF had to halt the eastward push and sign a ceasefire."],["Fregata","Ceasefires don't erase grudges. Soldiers ordered to stand down don't swallow it easy, do they?"],["Chloe","That's right... The ceasefire agreement merely shifted Milkhama from a hot war to a cold war. Hatred and interests have never left this island—they only went underground."],["Chloe","Many NDF soldiers stubbornly believe that the current problems of the UNCS and the predicament of Milkhama today all stem from that treaty the last war left behind."],["Chloe","The only solution is to fight a full-scale war even more brutal and massive than the border war... Only then can the UNCS achieve true revival."],["Chloe","Hence the name \"Revival Front.\""],["Celine","Meanwhile, strange phenomena have been occurring frequently on Milkhama, and rumors are spreading. One of these rumors is that Blair's back from the dead."],["Celine","Around Beloren, right here on the ground beneath our feet, more than one person has witnessed the former governor."],["Fregata","Putting returning from the dead even being possible aside..."],["Fregata","From what you've said, he sounds like a rampant schemer, not a coward skulking in the dark."],["Fregata","If he really has come back to life, he'd be moving his plots on day one... not hiding in the sticks."],["Chloe","Something's off... Too many parts of this feel wrong in ways I can't describe."],["Celine","Looking at it from another angle... Blair is not just a name, but a symbol carrying those obsessions and madness."],["Celine","It's also possible that all of this is someone meticulously setting the stage, wanting to use Blair as a banner to unite those warmongers under their command."],["Fregata","Then I really don't understand... Why would these war maniacs choose me, an outsider from another world?"],["Fregata","I've got nothing to do with them."],["Chloe","Yes, Miss Fregata just arrived in Milkhama, so logically, she shouldn't have any connection to them..."],["Celine","More importantly, how do they know all our action plans and routes?"],["Celine","I used encrypted channels the entire time. There's no way they could intercept our messages, unless... there's a mole in the Ashes."],["Chloe","Impossible! Everyone in the Ashes hates Blair to the bone—they wouldn't get involved with the likes of the Revival Front."],["Fregata","We won't reach any conclusions rambling on like this. There's a straightforward way to handle this kind of situation."],["Fregata","Since the Revival Front can ambush us, we can turn the tables and track them... just follow these guys and see what they're planning!"]],"560992101":[["Madland","\"STs,\" black technology, power struggles among major nations, rebels... What hasn't this place got going on? Everything the Complex has eaten before, your island's serving up again."],["Madland","Hah, sounds like your mess isn't any cleaner than the places I've been... No wonder your nerves are strung tight. Fair enough."],["Mary","Same here, after hearing about Zeke's greatest hits, I get why you tie him to the unknown STs."],["Mary","No clear purpose, no readable motive—just a feral fixation... not unlike our current predicament."],["Mary","By the way, you mentioned before that another companion of yours was caught up in this incident... Aren't you going to look for her?"],["Madland","You mean Fregata? Don't worry, she's tougher than Cosette and I combined. I don't need to worry about her."],["Madland","I've already handed over the information about her to your people. As for what happens next... let's leave it to time."],["Mary","Back to the task at hand."],["Mary","Next, we're officially entering the city of Beloren, where the Institute of Technology detected the arashi matter field."],["Mary","Stay sharp... odds are we'll run into those same clowns again."],["Madland","That said... the readings look odd. Aside from the marked coordinates, everything else is dead flat."],["Mary","Yeah—way too clean. Like something's luring us in."],["Madland","But even if it's a trap, it's worth the risk... After all, we don't have any other leads."],["","They ease their pace and cautiously slip into the zone."],["","But just as Madland is keeping an eye on the radar, Cosette's voice suddenly comes from behind."],["Cosette","Boss... are we really okay doing this?"],["Madland","Hasn't our cooperative operation been going smoothly so far? Any problems, Cosette?"],["Cosette","No... I just think we should keep some distance from the authorities."],["Cosette","Our original plan was just to get help like intelligence and supplies from them, not to get involved in local political disputes like we are now..."],["Madland","As long as Zeke is involved, it's no longer just their business."],["Madland","Don't forget, we ended up on this island because of his experiment. If we want to return to our world... we have to start with him."],["Madland","Whether it's mercenaries or rebels, no matter who Zeke Steel collaborates with... I'll drag him out myself!"],["Cosette","I'm not hung up on going back... I just don't want you doing anything suicidal again, Boss."],["Cosette","If we really can't go back, let's start a mercenary company here... No, maybe a real production company would work too..."],["","Cosette murmurs like she is talking to herself, her eyes glistening with tears as she recalls the past, like a treasure already lost."],["","But Madland, standing beside her, doesn't notice his companion's unusual state—his eyes are only on their insane target."],["Madland","Cosette... that's impossible."],["Cosette","......"],["Madland","Have you forgotten what Zeke did to Fregata, to you, and to Bernini?"],["Madland","His crimes are burned into my eyes. Even if I shut them, I still see that nauseating smile."],["Madland","I swore at Bernini's grave—I'd honor her with Zeke's blood, and if I say it, I do it!"],["Cosette","...Even if it costs you your life?"],["Madland","That's right... Even if it means risking my life, I won't let him go."],["","The sound of arguing comes to an abrupt halt with Madland's resolute answer, and silence spreads in its wake."],["","Looking into Cosette's eyes, for some reason, Madland feels a subtle sense of unfamiliarity."],["","Fatigue, confusion, helplessness... just like the castaway he used to be."],["Mary","Ahem... Are you done talking?"],["Cosette","C-Captain Mary! When did you..."],["Mary","Sorry, I don't have a habit of eavesdropping on private chatter... You left your channel open."],["Cosette","I'm sorry..."],["Mary","No need to apologize. You've been through hell. Venting is healthy."],["Mary","But keep your head—don't let feelings get in the way of what matters now."],["Cosette","You mean, the important matters... at hand?"],["Mary","Alright, enough of this nonsense."],["Mary","We're just a few steps away from the target location, so square up. What's waiting for us next... is a tough battle."]],"560992301":[["","After a long and grueling battle, the war machine finally succumbs to the sound of its armor being torn apart."],["","But strangely, it doesn't meet its end in the series of explosions caused by structural damage. Instead, it begins to disintegrate from the inside like a melting block of ice."],["Chloe","I can't believe... we actually managed to defeat the resurrected Blair from all those rumors."],["Mary","No—this is a fake, no question. The piloting was stiff—rookie-grade."],["Mary","Take a closer look, this ST is at best just a shell of Hades, with no sign of any pilot present."],["Mary","You... don't actually believe those rumors about Blair's resurrection, do you?"],["Chloe","Oh? If the NDF's so well-informed, why did your so-called \"empty shell\" herd you around like a bunch of ducklings?"],["Chloe","If we hadn't come to help... you might've been blown sky-high by now!"],["","Watching the two bicker, Madland can only give a helpless smile."],["Fregata","Your partner... doesn't seem too friendly."],["Madland","Let them blow off some steam... We've all waded through enough crap on this road."],["","From unknown STs to the Revival Front, the three exchange their intel as briefly as possible... At this point, Madland can't help but furrow his brow."],["Madland","It seems things are not that simple, and Zeke's involvement with this island might run deeper than we imagined."],["Fregata","Yeah. We meant to shadow the Revival Front and shake loose some leads... then ran straight into your mess."],["Fregata","By the way, I have a question—Cosette, how did you get involved in all of this?"],["Fregata","By your account... you hit Zeke's old lab and tripped the Shadowrabbit too?"],["Cosette","Yes, that's right... After I recovered from my injuries and saw that you hadn't returned, I decided to set out."],["Cosette","I followed the information you left behind, struggling all the way, and finally found Zeke's secret base..."],["Fregata","Oh? But during this operation, we were drifting at sea the whole time and barely left a paper trail."],["Fregata","How did you find those clues?"],["Cosette","B-Because..."],["","Cosette stammers, her eyes flickering with unease."],["","Looking at the hesitant girl in front of her... Even though her face is familiar, Fregata feels a deep, creeping strangeness."],["Madland","Freg, ease up on Cosette. After all she's been through, a foggy memory's to be expected."],["Fregata","Alright, alright. Dropping it. Back to business."],["Fregata","Madland, what's the play—keep chasing that mech?"],["Madland","Yeah. That rig's tech is way beyond this island, and the cut-throat style screams Zeke."],["Madland","Plus that sick joke of a paint job... I can't think of anyone else who fits the bill."],["Madland","If we leave it unchecked... who knows what kind of scheme he'll cook up."],["Celine","If that's the case, count me in."],["Fregata","Hey, intel broker... don't be so quick to volunteer. He won't be as simple to beat as you might think."],["Fregata","Zeke is an extremely dangerous person. Once you get involved with him, the risks you'll face will spike tenfold."],["Fregata","The contract you signed with us only includes finding people. You don't need to risk your life."],["Celine","Forget the fee..."],["Celine","Beloren's my home. I won't forgive whoever turned it into a scrapyard."],["Chloe","Count me in as well."],["Chloe","My task was originally to investigate these anomalies. If I can solve the problem at its source... all the better."],["Madland","Captain Mary, mind a few extra hands?"],["Mary","No complaints here. More help's always good—just don't slow us down."],["Madland","Good... Then let's start the hunt."]],"560904101":[["Cosette","Boss, I've detected that abnormal signal!"],["Cosette","The monitor shows the target is moving along the perimeter toward the East District... According to estimates, within two hours, he'll be gone."],["Cosette","If we want to capture him... this is our last chance."],["Mary","I propose we conduct a lockdown operation."],["Mary","We immediately advance at full speed, get ahead of him, and set up a blockade on his path."],["Chloe","But there are only six of us in total... Setting up a blockade might be a bit too much for us to handle."],["Chloe","If you ask me, we use our mobility. Split up—one team pins, the other moves to encircle."],["Chloe","That way, even if there's a gap in the front line, we can flexibly cover it."],["Mary","But what if the distraction team fails and lets the target escape? Or if the team responsible for encircling slips up and the breaks through?"],["Mary","Flexibility is not a replacement for contingency planning. If there's one mistake, it's all over."],["Mary","This opponent is cunning, and we only have one chance... There's no room for failure."],["Chloe","But your plan isn't realistic either. After all, we can only speculate on his general direction. We still don't know where exactly he'll go."],["Chloe","Can we really box him in like this?"],["","The discussion between the two gradually reaches an impasse. Madland doesn't rush to make a decision but instead walks over to the liaison."],["Madland","What do you think, liaison?"],["Madland","These ruins are your home. I want your take."],["Celine","If you ask me, neither plan is very realistic."],["","Celine's gaze points forward, her eyes reflecting a desolate scene."],["","Broken roads, exposed steel bars, and the scars of war fire are etched into the land."],["","They call it Beloren City, but there's no city left—just wind humming through bones of concrete."],["Celine","Beloren's nothing but wreckage. Whether it's the blockade mentioned by Captain Mary or the encirclement Chloe talked about, they all present insurmountable difficulties."],["Madland","Then let's find a way."],["Madland","Tell me the city's past. What did Beloren go through to end up like this?"],["","Celine's gaze is somewhat evasive, but after a brief pause, she parts her lips."],["Celine","Beloren... was originally a neutral city that did not involve itself in the conflicts between the East and the West."],["Celine","However, during the border wars, due to the UNCS's eastward campaign and Blair's coercion, this place eventually became their bridgehead."],["Celine","The UNCS viewed this city as a crucial node on their eastern supply line, while the DL saw it as the key to severance. Soon, a tug-of-war erupted between the two sides here."],["Madland","But a regular war wouldn't result in such a devastating scene, would it?"],["Madland","No matter how intense the battles between STs get, the highest they reach is the firepower level of missiles and artillery, far from being able to level a city like this."],["Celine","Because the tug-of-war wasn't the whole story."],["Celine","...The DLAF quickly broke through the outer defenses of the city. Facing imminent defeat, the NDF didn't pull out—they dragged the line into the city and took hostages."],["Celine","In the end, the main forces of the DLAF invaded Beloren, and both sides engaged in a brutal urban battle... leading to a devastating explosion that engulfed the entire city."],["Celine","Both forces were obliterated—and the city's future died alongside them."],["Celine","My mother and father... they didn't make it either."],["Madland","......"],["Madland","...I'm sorry for bringing up bad memories."],["Celine","It's okay, I'm used to it. I know that my hometown will only ever exist in memories now."],["Celine","That cataclysm left Beloren loaded with arashi matter. It's... impossible to rebuild here."],["Madland","Are you saying there's still arashi matter in this city?"],["Celine","Yes, because of that battle, there's still a lot of unrecoverable arashi matter beneath the ruins of this city... That's why it's been abandoned until now."],["Madland","Wait... I think I've got it."],["","Madland quickly stands up and starts fiddling with the monitor in his hand."],["Madland","Captain Mary, do you have a way to confirm the distribution of arashi matter within Beloren City?"],["Mary","Before heading to Beloren, the people from the Institute of Technology gave me a report on arashi matter monitoring in Beloren. Feed it into the scanner and we'll have a heatmap."],["Mary","Are you planning to..."],["Madland","Seems we're thinking the same. Cosette, pull the densest arashi cluster in East District—now."],["Madland","That place, there... is Zeke Steel's inevitable path."]],"560904301":[["","Rage as he may, Madland's fury cannot overcome such overwhelming odds. With the help of the phantom ST, Zeke quickly distances himself from his nemesis."],["Zeke","Heh, there were a few hiccups... but it mostly went according to plan."],["Zeke","Next step—get out of the city and move to phase two..."],["","But the moment he turns the corner, a sudden chill shoots up his spine."],["","What greets Zeke is not his previously-arranged sentinel... but the dark muzzle of a gun."],["Cosette","End of the line, Zeke Steel."],["Zeke","Cosette? Interesting, I thought you would just pull the trigger..."],["","Cosette doesn't respond to Zeke's taunt. Instead, she answers by smashing the butt of the gun into his forehead."],["","The cold sting forces Zeke to lower his head and let out a series of low groans."],["Cosette","Don't think I won't do it."],["Cosette","I'm sparing your life because you're useful... The boss needs you to send us back to our world."],["Cosette","If you resist—I don't mind putting a few holes in you."],["Zeke","Heh... You won't kill me."],["","Zeke slowly raises his head. There isn't a trace of fear in his aged eyes."],["Zeke","Because... you don't actually want to return, do you?"],["Cosette","...You can't resist, so now you're getting glib?"],["Zeke","No, no, no.., you can fool them, but you can't fool me."],["Zeke","From the start, my targets were only Mr. Guan and Miss Fregata... You were never in that laboratory."],["Cosette","......"],["","Seizing upon Cosette's hesitation, Zeke takes a step toward the muzzle."],["Zeke","There's only one possibility... You found the ruins, activated the device, and chose to come to this world!"],["Zeke","Yes, that's right—you're a variable, you don't even belong to that time..."],["Zeke","Think carefully... If I get caught here, how will the story end?"],["Zeke","Everything returns to normal, everything goes back to the way it was... Is that really what you want, time traveler?"],["Cosette","Spare me the theatrics!"],["Zeke","Heh... Since you're unwilling to face your own heart, I'll let the facts speak for themselves."],["","As if seeing through the her thoughts, Zeke relaxedly waves his hand and projects a blueprint onto the screen beside him."],["Cosette","Is this... the design blueprint for the ND device?! How did you..."],["Zeke","Heh, as expected of someone from the future, you recognized its significance at a glance."],["Zeke","Although it's still just a prototype... it already holds the potential to change the past."],["Zeke","You went through so much to get here... It must be for a nobler cause, yes?"],["Zeke","And I can offer you a second possibility..."],["Cosette","......"],["","Zeke can clearly feel the muzzle on his forehead trembling, as unsteady as the wielder herself..."],["","After some struggle, the girl finally moves the handgun away."],["Cosette","Disappear."],["Cosette","I'll give you ten seconds... Disappear from my sight, right now!"],["Zeke","Then I shall respectfully comply."],["Zeke","But rest assured... we will meet again soon."],["Cosette","Sorry, boss... he got away."],["Cosette","I wasted the valuable opportunity you provided. In the end, all I managed was damaging his mech."],["Madland","Don't worry about it, you've done well... I was too impulsive following his lead."],["Madland","Still, we didn't walk away empty-handed."],["Madland","At least we confirmed one important thing—these mysterious mechs were personally created by Zeke himself."],["","Madland lifts a part torn from Zeke's chassis. The remaining phantom STs, as though receiving a command, move in the corresponding direction."],["Fregata","How the hell did he pull this off? Even our world doesn't have that kind of tech."],["Madland","I think... the problem probably lies with these mechs."],["","After speaking, Madland looks at the wreckage on the ground."],["","Upon closer inspection, it is made of neither sturdy steel plates nor precise components, but rather pitch-black shards like glass."],["Madland","If you look closely, you'll find that these mechs aren't made from regular materials at all."],["Madland","Strictly speaking, it's more like some kind of device wrapped in a mech shell."],["Mary","No matter how bold the design, the mechs that come out of military factories are ultimately industrial products that conform to structural mechanics."],["Mary","The fragments before us have completely departed from the realm of normal materials."],["Cosette","These fragments... they resemble ND ore."],["Mary","ND ore... What's that?"],["","Madland pauses for a moment, as if recalling an unforgettable memory."],["Madland","It's a special substance from our world, used as a universal material in every aspect of the known world, from armor and weapons to engines and energy."],["Madland","When I was a researcher at Titan Industries, ND ore was the gold standard."],["Madland","But... even if it is ND ore, it's ultimately just a material. It shouldn't be able to rewrite a mech like this, right?"],["Cosette","No, the potential of ND ore goes far beyond that. You can... think of it as a lens that refracts matter."],["Cosette","\"Projecting and reproducing past objects into the present\"... This is the most direct and essential characteristic of ND ore."],["Cosette","Zeke doesn't need to produce them on the assembly line at all, he just needs to revert what once existed here."],["Cosette","Remember? Miss Celine mentioned before that a fierce war once broke out in Beloren... and these mechs were probably projected from that time."],["Madland","Projecting things from the past to the present... Is such a thing really possible?"],["Mary","I can second Cosette's statement... I recorded the identification numbers of those unidentified STs and submitted them to the GSA for verification."],["Mary","The database results show that these numbers were used decades ago... by the NDF during the border war period."],["Mary","I originally thought this was a camouflage tactic, but now it seems... it might really be as Cosette said..."],["Celine","So according to your speculation—the phantom ST team and Blair are essentially just holograms of the past?"],["Cosette","That's right. The lens effect of ND ore isn't stable, so these holographic STs burn out after a while."],["Cosette","This probably explains why they always come and go without a trace, only existing in rumors."],["Fregata","Wait, Cosette... where did you learn all this from?"],["Fregata","What you're saying is enough to overturn the Complex's academic definition of ND ore... You didn't learn about this from Madland."],["Cosette","Th-This is just the conclusion I deduced based on the existing clues."],["Cosette","I mean, the boss... he certainly would've come to a similar conclusion."],["Madland","No, I hadn't thought about this possibility at all... To be honest, even the researchers at Titan Industries delving deeply into the field of ND ore wouldn't propose such a bold hypothesis."],["Madland","Cosette, you really..."],["","Faced with Madland's questioning, Cosette seems to realize something. She turns her head, avoiding his gaze."],["Mary","In that case, the situation is even more urgent... We must quickly find Zeke's whereabouts."],["Mary","Milkhama is a land watered with blood and tears. During the border wars alone, there were no less than a hundred battles fought, both large and small."],["Mary","If the source of the holographic STs is truly fallen soldiers from past battlefields into the present... then every inch of land on Milkhama, from west to east, could become their breeding ground."],["Celine","Indeed, far more than just the city of Beloren was destroyed by the war..."],["Celine","If we let this madman go unchecked... the entire island will inevitably fall into irreversible ruin."],["Mary","We can't wait any longer. I'll contact HQ immediately to report the current situation."],["","Due to the signal blockage in the city, Mary had almost lost contact with headquarters. As soon as she turns on her communicator, the channel immediately receives an urgent call that had been pending for a long time."],["UNCS Soldier","This is the 5th Mobile. We've encountered armed conflict in Battle Zone E21 and urgently need support."],["UNCS Soldier","Repeat, we are engaged in armed conflict, the situation is critical. All NDF units receiving this signal, please support us immediately!"],["Mary","Wait, the location of Battle Zone E21 is... the Ashes' camp."],["Mary","The NDF... What are they doing there?!"]],"560993101":[["","Professor Zeke, why has your unit taken such damage? What exactly have you been doing?!"],["Zeke","Ah, it's nothing. I just ran into an old friend on the way and caught up a little."],["","Although I always adhere to the principle of cooperation without interference... I must remind you not to get too deeply involved with them!"],["Zeke","Haha, let's not point fingers. All I've been doing is harvesting arashi matter—they came to me."],["Zeke","Instead of blaming me, you should take a look at yourself."],["Zeke","If the assassins you sent were a bit more competent and successfully dealt with Fregata's group, would I still be entangled with them?"],["","...I just hope you can focus your energy on what matters."],["Zeke","Hahaha, don't worry, when it comes to research, you and I want the same thing."],["Zeke","For me, this island has neither the supervision of the Complex nor those annoying pursuers... It's simply a natural testing ground!"],["Zeke","Of course, the most important thing is the arashi matter... It's the first time I've seen a substance that can continuously evolve yet remain stable, like an ouroboros eating its tail!"],["Zeke","Thanks to this material, I was able to break through those bottlenecks I encountered in my world... and build the true prototype of the BIRD/BINARY System."],["","Your dedication is... encouraging."],["","But I must remind you... we don't have much time left."],["","Because of the things you created in Beloren, the UNCS is becoming increasingly anxious, and they... are about to uncover the truth."],["Zeke","Don't worry, they won't catch up."],["Zeke","At this point, we're just one step away from completing the BIRD/BINARY System. It's only a matter of time."],["","That's just a verbal estimate, isn't it? Maybe you're overly optimistic about all this."],["","From start to finish, aside from the destruction caused through your experiments, you haven't shared any relevant knowledge with me."],["Zeke","There's no need. The details, the theories—leave that to me. You need only concern yourself with how to make use of the results."],["Zeke","A thousand years ago, sailors couldn't understand the principles of ocean currents, yet they still sailed the seas. The serfs of ancient empires hadn't heard of genetics, yet they still farmed and bred."],["Zeke","Aren't you the best example yourself, my dear collaborator?"],["Zeke","Even though you only have a superficial understanding of arashi matter, you still managed to turn it into a phenomenal killing tool—turning a city as large as Beloren into a wasteland."],["","......"],["Blair Commissioner","Have you made up your mind? The time Blair has given you to consider is running out."],["Blair Commissioner","There's nothing to hesitate about. Blair has approved both the design report and the experiment data... He highly values your achievements."],["Blair Commissioner","A position at the Institute of Technology has been prepared for you. As soon as you sign, the NDF will take immediate action."],["Blair Commissioner","You know, opportunities like this are rare. Even top research personnel don't get a chance like this by just nodding and bowing..."],["Security Chief","Think—don't believe his promises!"],["Security Chief","Arashi matter explosives have never been used outside of the test site... Even we can't estimate their true power."],["Security Chief","We can't gamble with the future of the entire city!"],["","..."],["Blair Commissioner","What's this? A simple security chief dares to speak so recklessly?!"],["Blair Commissioner","Someone, throw him into the confinement room—have the guards settle him down!"],["Blair Commissioner","So... what's your answer? You wouldn't be as rash as him, would you?"],["","......"],["","Professor Zeke... you're mocking me."],["Zeke","Take it as a compliment... How can you change the world without a touch of madness?"],["","Enough, I don't have time to discuss these trivial matters with you."],["","Let's get this done cleanly and efficiently, Professor Zeke... If we drag this out any longer, it might lead to unforeseen complications."],["","I'll find a way to play the cards in my hand and buy you some more time."],["","Let's start with... the Ashes."]],"560905101":[["","The Ashes Camp"],["Marcus","Stop, NDF! Not a step closer."],["Marcus","If we showed any less restraint, you'd have been riddled with holes the moment you crossed the checkpoint."],["Marcus","Do not mistake our patience for an invitation!"],["UNCS Military Officer","I return these words to you verbatim."],["UNCS Military Officer","We have made it very clear that the NDF has traced Yevgeny's tracks and needs your assistance in the investigation."],["UNCS Military Officer","Your uncooperative behavior only further solidifies our suspicion that you're colluding with Yevgeny!"],["Marcus","...Are you suspecting us of harboring Goman?"],["Marcus","Let me tell you the truth, ever since that man defected and disappeared, leaving a mess in his wake, the Ashes have had nothing to do with him."],["Marcus","No, I should say... If anything, we want him found more than you do."],["Marcus","If that traitor dares show his face, I'll be first to break his nose!"],["UNCS Military Officer","But that's not what our reconnaissance report says. More than one soldier has seen Yevgeny around the city of Beloren."],["UNCS Military Officer","He even... attacked our transport squad with the Ashes' STs."],["UNCS Military Officer","At this point, the NDF can't turn a blind eye anymore... Open the roadblock and let our people in!"],["","Marcus shows no sign of backing down. Instead, he meets the other's gaze with determination."],["Marcus","What a joke... Just bring up Goman and you can dump any dirt on the Ashes?"],["Marcus","Let me ask you this—if you care so much about Goman, then why ignore all those rumors about Blair?"],["Marcus","Our people also saw Blair and his phantom ST guards! Now, the rumors of him being back from the dead are spreading across the entire island... Instead of dealing with it, you come after us?!"],["UNCS Military Officer","Because this whole resurrection thing is nonsense!"],["UNCS Military Officer","Blair's death report and inquiry were open and clean—you were there."],["UNCS Military Officer","The UNCS conducted a thorough settlement of Blair's demise afterward... This name has been swept into the scrap heap of history, with no political value remaining at all."],["Marcus","What's going on with the Revival Front? Those rebels claim to be the true NDF, plundering wherever they go under its banner. This doesn't line up with your story."],["Marcus","I'm even starting to suspect... that all of this was actually a trap—a carefully planned fake death staged by the UNCS."],["UNCS Military Officer","I take it we can't reach a consensus?"],["UNCS Military Officer","If you insist on going your own way, then we will have no choice but to take coercive measures!"],["","Suspicion and hostility fill the entire camp, and just as the STs on both sides are on the verge of firing shots, an elderly figure appears at the center of the battlefield."],["Lando","What are you all arguing about? Must everything end in blood with you people?"],["Marcus","Everyone, put down your weapons... Do not harm Dr. Lando!"],["UNCS Military Officer","Dr. Lando... Why have you come here from the Institute of Technology?"],["UNCS Military Officer","A person of your stature appearing in the Ashes' camp will cause unnecessary controversy..."],["Lando","I'm already halfway to the grave. My reputation is of no use to me..."],["Lando","These are troubled times, with rumors and strange events putting everyone on edge... At such a time, we need to remain calm and restrained."],["Marcus","But Dr. Lando, this matter has already gone beyond what the Ashes are willing to stand for. We absolutely cannot..."],["Lando","There's no need to make a fuss over someone who's already dead. Alright, everyone calm down and let's talk this through."],["Lando","Tell me, what exactly is—"],["","Without warning or declaration, the sound of artillery tearing through the air shrieks across the battlefield like the wail of death."],["","At the center of the standoff between the UNCS and the Ashes, missiles rain down like a storm..."],["","In an instant, flames and thick smoke completely engulf the old man's figure."],["UNCS Military Officer","*cough, cough* Dr. Lando—!"],["UNCS Military Officer","These bastards! Just to buy time, they'd even use a neutral like Dr. Lando as a sacrifice... Yevgeny, is this part of your scheme too?"],["UNCS Military Officer","Second Squad, Third Squad, immediately rally and prepare to launch an attack."],["UNCS Military Officer","There's no need to hold back anymore. Completely crush the Ashes!"]],"560905301":[["Marcus","Hmm, Chloe, according to what you're saying..."],["Marcus","Both the Blair we saw and the Yevgeny mentioned by the UNCS... they're all fake, like some kind of projection?"],["Chloe","Strictly speaking, they were replicated from the past to the present through some special technology... These STs are projections from the past, but they still possess considerable destructive power."],["Chloe","This is also why there have been constant rumors about unidentified STs and mirages recently."],["Marcus","Wait, slow down... I-I can barely keep up..."],["Fregata","In short, all you need to know is that both sides are victims, and the real mastermind is a bastard named Zeke Steel."],["","At that moment, a commotion arises on the other side of the crowd."],["UNCS Military Officer","Projections? Holograms...? This is utter nonsense!"],["UNCS Military Officer","The entire NDF has been at their wits' end over these bizarre incidents for a month without figuring it out... and yet you guys settle it with just a few words."],["UNCS Military Officer","Do you have any evidence to support your claims? Photos, videos, research reports... even one piece would do!"],["Celine","Of course, these STs wouldn't leave any evidence... They are essentially just projections of the past."],["Celine","Otherwise, those ridiculous rumors wouldn't have appeared."],["UNCS Military Officer","So... you can't provide a shred of evidence?"],["UNCS Military Officer","Then it sounds like nothing more than an excuse!"],["Mary","No, I can vouch for them."],["UNCS Military Officer","Captain Mary?! You're also a member of the NDF—why are you siding with them?"],["UNCS Military Officer","Don't tell me you've also fallen for this nonsense?"],["Mary","It's because what Chloe is describing—I've experienced it myself."],["Mary","I, Mary Rodriguez, can vouch for it as a captain of the NDF."],["UNCS Military Officer","You're an academy instructor... On what authority?"],["UNCS Military Officer","What we need is evidence, not..."],["","Mary, without any regard for courtesy, sternly interrupts the officer's incessant speech."],["Mary","I will submit a thorough and detailed investigation report to the General Security Administration. If any issues arise, I am willing to take full responsibility."],["Mary","However... if anyone stubbornly insists on delaying the current investigation, I'll file that too."],["UNCS Military Officer","......"],["Mary","Does anyone else have any questions?"],["","Mary's gaze sweeps over the soldiers like a sharp sword, silencing the previously restless crowd."],["Mary","Marcus, I apologize for the NDF's reckless actions... With all this tension adding up, everyone snapped."],["Marcus","It's not entirely your fault. After all... I couldn't rein in my hotheads either."],["Marcus","By the way, regarding the culprit who attacked Dr. Lando... Celine, do you have anything on your side?"],["Celine","I pulled every camera near the camp. Nothing. To avoid all surveillance, I'm afraid the shooter came prepared."],["Marcus","Celine, I'm sorry... If it weren't for our security oversight, Dr. Lando wouldn't have..."],["Celine","......"],["Celine","It seems this conflict was more than just an accidental skirmish... It's more like someone took advantage of the tension between both sides and deliberately fired that shot."],["Fregata","We don't have the luxury of playing detective now."],["Fregata","While you were tearing each other up, Zeke walked free."],["Fregata","His ambition runs deeper than we know... The longer we stall, the closer this island gets to hell."],["Marcus","Rest assured, the Ashes won't sit this out."],["Marcus","As compensation for earlier, I'll hand over all the intel we Ashes have collected along the way."],["Marcus","I believe that in the hands of the GSA, this information will pull weight."]],"560906101":[["Rosemary","Captain Mary, the GSA has your full report."],["Rosemary","I have officially synchronized Zeke Steel's information with all intelligence departments, and the DL has also promised to cooperate with us in the manhunt..."],["Rosemary","That leaves him nowhere to hide on Milkhama."],["Mary","Credit where it's due. In truth, I was only a guide. These unexpected guests found the trail."],["Madland","It's fine. After all, we're all in the same boat... I should thank you for giving me a chance for revenge."],["Madland","So... any leads on where Zeke is hiding now?"],["Natalia","Yes. After combing hundreds of anomalies, we found a pattern..."],["Natalia","\"Unknown STs,\" \"Blair's Resurrection\"... almost every event has cleverly touched on sensitive issues on this island."],["Celine","Could they be deliberately manipulating public opinion and inciting chaos to cover up their true intentions?"],["Celine","But... the first report was only a month ago. Can an outsider like Zeke really accomplish all this in such a short time?"],["Natalia","Very perceptive, Little Harpy."],["Natalia","The answer is already clear... Zeke isn't our only enemy."],["Natalia","Obviously, there is someone who can navigate between various forces and is familiar with the situation in Milkhama, constantly assisting him."],["Natalia","That person took advantage of the conflicts on Milkhama to cleverly cover up Zeke's actions... Whether it's the UNCS or the Ashes, they are all being used as tools."],["Fregata","I knew there was a reason we kept hitting roadblocks and falling into traps. Turns out someone was secretly sabotaging us."],["Fregata","What kind of person would choose to collaborate with a lunatic like Zeke... Aren't they afraid of dragging the entire island down with them?"],["Natalia","Birds of a feather flock together, and madness and obsession are traits of their own..."],["Natalia","Actually, you've already dealt with these people before—they are the \"Revival Front\" you encountered earlier."],["Natalia","According to communications intercepted by our agents, we've confirmed that the Revival Front members have had direct contact and technical exchanges with Zeke Steel."],["Celine","These war maniacs keep talking about reviving the UNCS... Aren't they just your pet thugs?"],["Celine","Or are you just now realizing you can't control them and plan to wash your hands of all this?"],["Natalia","No. From the start, they were just one cluster of Blair's leftovers."],["Natalia","Predators, Mercenaries, NDF, and Yevgeny... The empire Blair built is like a withered tree sprawled across the island—roots snarled everywhere."],["Natalia","Even if the trunk is cut down, the roots won't wither immediately. The NDF has long distanced itself from these rebels loyal to Blair, but due to the circumstances... it cannot completely eradicate them."],["Natalia","Please believe that in maintaining the peace of Milkhama, we are completely aligned with you."],["","As the words fall, a coordinate flashes on the screen in the center of the room."],["Madland","Is this their base of operations?"],["Madland","Valleys, ravines, ruins... They're hiding pretty deep."],["Natalia","That's right, but before we take action, there's one more thing I want to remind you of."],["Natalia","These Revival Front Soldiers... are a bit strange."],["Madland","Do you really need to remind us? Their minds are clearly cracked, aren't they?"],["Natalia","No, it's something else."],["Natalia","Military satellites show that their ST formations far exceed the scale we previously recorded, and even now they continue to expand."],["Natalia","It's like... they're being conjured out of thin air by something."],["Madland","It's those holographic STs!"],["Madland","...Damn, it seems they've found a way to stably project holograms."],["Cosette","If Zeke's ND research is that far along, then—"],["Fregata","What's there to be afraid of? Just a bigger pile of the same trash."],["Fregata","Standing around worrying changes nothing. The longer we wait, the bigger the mess we'll have to deal with later."]],"560906301":[["Celine","The battlefield has been cleared, except for a few of the gravely wounded..."],["Celine","The other Revival Front soldiers either fought to the death or self-destructed on the spot... The only thing left is these encrypted communication devices..."],["Fregata","To go this far for obsession's sake... I really don't know whether to call them steadfast or insane."],["Cosette","Probably a bit of both."],["Cosette","Those ND devices are not just combat equipment for pawns like them—they're a lifeline."],["Cosette","They're remnants of the war era... It's the only thing that makes them feel alive."],["Madland","Maybe for those who refuse reality, dying here is a mercy."],["Madland","People must eventually let go of the past and move toward the future."],["Cosette","...But what if that future means destruction?"],["","Without warning, the girl's tone suddenly turns cold, surprising even Madland."],["Madland","Cosette, why... why would you ask such a question?"],["Cosette","Suppose, just suppose... Boss, you saw the future somehow..."],["Cosette","And discovered that the path you chose is a road of no return, no matter how you struggle, it only leads to inevitable death."],["Cosette","Boss... when would you choose to turn back?"],["Madland","I guess I'd just keep going."],["Cosette","...Even if you know it's a dead end?"],["","This time, Cosette's voice is mixed with displeasure and confusion."],["Madland","You've already said it's \"the path you chose\"—and I never make meaningless choices."],["Madland","As long as it's the path I chose, even if I'm forced to give up halfway, I'll find a way back—no matter the price."],["Madland","In that case, why not follow your heart and just go all the way to the end?"],["Madland","Dying without regrets is better than living with remorse."],["Cosette","Such a choice... what meaning does it have besides self-satisfaction?"],["Madland","Because choice itself is the meaning... We can't see the future or rewrite the past. All we own is each choice we make."],["Madland","Of course, this is ultimately my personal view... If that day truly comes, I won't force you and Fregata to make the same choice as me."],["Madland","Just like I said when you first joined Donau, if you ever get tired of it, you can leave at any time."],["Fregata","Hmph, easy for you to say... You still owe me a few lives, jerk."],["Fregata","Planning to skip out on the debt?"],["Fregata","I'm telling you, Madland, until you pay up, I'll chase you to hell."],["Madland","Cosette's just joking. Where's your head at? Besides..."],["Madland","I won't die that easily."],["Fregata","Heh, I'm just reminding you..."],["Fregata","So..."],["","Fregata shifts her focus and looks at the blue-haired girl beside her."],["Fregata","Cosette—if it were you, what would you do?"],["Cosette","......"],["","Cosette lowers her head, avoiding Fregata's counter-question."],["","But for some reason, what Fregata sees in her eyes is not hesitation or doubt, but an undeniable determination."],["Mary","Pardon the interruption, but the communication equipment we found at the Revival Front base has undergone preliminary decryption."],["Mary","It's just..."],["Madland","Huh? It's rare to see you hesitate... What happened?"],["Mary","I can't say for sure... Please go and see for yourselves."],["","Entering the communication room, they find Celine has already arrived. She silently stares at the information screen in a daze."],["Celine","No, it's not possible..."],["Fregata","What could've rattled her that hard? Let me take a look..."],["","The content displayed on the screen ranges from military deployment to logistical supplies, resembling the command hub of the Revival Front."],["Fregata","Operational planning, dispatch arrangements, echelon control... every step is encrypted. This information chain could only have been created by professionals."],["Fregata","It's a pity that now the stronghold has been taken down, even the best security is meaningless."],["","Fregata presses the button to start playing past communications, but what appears is a familiar face."],["Lando","...Is it clear now? This person from another world is an enemy of your Revival Front."],["Lando","Do not question my decision! Don't forget, all of this is for your cause."],["","End of message. Starting next message."],["Lando","...I have already locked onto this group's travel route from the Ashes. Finish them off before they trespass into Beloren."],["Lando","Members of the Revival Front, redeem yourselves—don't let me down."],["","End of message. Starting next message."],["Lando","I have delivered Professor Zeke's full equipment. Make good use of it."],["Lando","Also... UNCS forces have been restless lately... Stay alert and be ready for combat at any time."],["","End of message. Starting next message."],["Lando","...I'll repeat it again, UNCS forces are rapidly approaching your area! Please confirm immediately, I need your response!"],["Lando","No response, is it already too late...?"],["","As the last message finishes playing, the communication room is left in dead silence, accompanied only by Celine's faint sobs."],["Celine","The true traitor... turned out to be Dr. Lando..."],["Celine","All this time... what have I been doing...?"]],"560994101":[["Zeke","Interesting, facing the enemy's pursuit, they actually used the headquarters as bait."],["Zeke","A case of cutting one's losses, or perhaps it was just the end of the line... What do you think, my dear collaborator?"],["Lando","No need to be sarcastic with me... Professor Steel."],["Lando","The Revival Front is merely a tool for us to achieve our goals. You know this all too well."],["Zeke","Haha, of course I know."],["Zeke","Let them scream about righteousness as they hurl themselves into their graves. It's all they were ever good for. At least they'll die satisfied."],["Zeke","I notice you're no longer creeping in the shadows. You strolled in like it's Sunday mass. No longer afraid of being caught?"],["Lando","We've come this far. There's no use hiding anymore."],["Lando","Now let's put aside these trivial matters and get to the point... What about the things you promised?"],["Zeke","On that front, there's good news and bad news."],["Zeke","The good news is that the framework of the BIRD/BINARY System has been completed. The key to change the past is now in your hands."],["Lando","Oh, then why are my hands still empty?"],["Zeke","That's the bad news. Although I've completed the framework, the current BIRD/BINARY System is still just a prototype."],["Zeke","It's like the bacteria we meticulously cultivate in a petri dish, with a whole slew of precise requirements for the application environment and the composition of arashi matter."],["Lando","Get to the point, Professor Steel. What is it you need?"],["Zeke","In short, to successfully activate it, we need to go to the city of Beloren and do some preliminary work."],["Zeke","...While that's in progress, I'd prefer not to be disturbed."],["Lando","Hmph, by now I'm used to your bizarre requests."],["Lando","I'll concentrate all remaining power at that city... We'll buy you the window you need."],["Lando","But I must remind you, our remaining forces are not enough to confront the UNCS head-on... I don't want our efforts to end in vain."],["Zeke","You needn't worry. You may have gone all-in—but I still have an ace up my sleeve."],["Lando","...This is the first I'm hearing of it."],["Zeke","Ah, games are won or lost on information disparities, you see... Just watch the table—you'll see that winning hand soon enough."],["Zeke","Speaking of which, how is the child you adopted doing? I remember her name was... Celine, yes?"],["Zeke","If she learns what her beloved Lando really is... you're not scared she'll break?"],["","A flicker of sorrow and doubt cross Lando's usually steely face."],["Lando","...It's my fault, this child... will probably be devastated."],["Lando","But she's different from me... One day, she'll move on."],["Lando","She still has a future, while I... am left with this pathetic past..."],["Zeke","Don't worry, you'll soon bid farewell to such a past and embrace a beautiful ending that's all your own."],["","With Lando's departure, the dim room is left with only Zeke."],["Zeke","Alright, multiple-choice questions, true or false questions, essay questions... the entire test paper is complete."],["Zeke","Let me see, what kind of answer will you give this time... Mr. Guan Yiwen."],["Mary","And so... that's the situation."],["Natalia","Zeke's escape, Lando's betrayal... the situation is indeed grim."],["Celine","I'm sorry... this was my failure as a liaison..."],["Celine","My negligence led to this situation. If only I had been more vigilant with Dr. Lando..."],["Natalia","Don't blame yourself... Given their style of operation, the so-called headquarters was just a decoy to attract our firepower."],["Natalia","If there's blame to be laid, it's also on the GSA... We failed to thoroughly investigate Dr. Lando at the first opportunity."],["Fregata","Hey, we didn't rush back here just to play the blame game."],["Fregata","If they ran, they ran. We'll just find a way to catch them again."],["Fregata","Is there no other valuable information among the things left by the Revival Front?"],["Natalia","That's exactly what I was going to say... We've urgently called in the UNCS Electronic Warfare Department to assist Naomi with the decryption."],["Natalia","The Zeke and Lando you're tracking are now hiding in the central area of Beloren City."],["Celine","Beloren... Why would they go there?"],["Natalia","Unfortunately, we don't know the specific reason either."],["Natalia","All we know is that since just now, observation teams around Beloren have been continuously sending reports of abnormal phenomena."],["Natalia","Meanwhile, the Institute of Technology has also sent a warning, informing us that the activity of arashi matter in Beloren is showing an exponential growth trend, spreading around the city."],["Cosette","It seems... their plan has reached the final step."],["Fregata","The final step? Cosette, how do you know that?"],["Cosette","Do you remember those holographic STs we saw?"],["Cosette","Simply put, they polish the arashi matter into a mirror, projecting past STs into the present."],["Fregata","Yeah, like you said before, it's actually some kind of optical lens."],["Cosette","So suppose you put hundreds or thousands of optical lenses together, refracting all the light sources onto a piece of white paper... what would happen to that paper?"],["Fregata","I reckon... it would probably get burned through due to concentrated heat, reduced to ashes..."],["Cosette","This is what they're doing now... creating a time-distorting \"rift\" in Beloren through this method."],["Fregata","Is this a joke? How could something like this be possible...?"],["Natalia","I think... Miss Cosette is serious."],["Natalia","Because the theoretical physicists at the UNCS Institute of Engineering and Technology have also proposed similar theories to Miss Cosette's."],["Celine","But... why Beloren?"],["Celine","This city was once Dr. Lando's hometown. It doesn't make sense... he couldn't possibly do something like that!"],["Rosemary","No, Dr. Lando has his reasons."],["","The governor stationed in Milkhama breaks the silence with words that carry an undeniable power."],["Rosemary","Do you remember the explosion in Beloren?"],["Celine","How could I forget... It was because you and the DLAF fought in the city, disregarding the lives of the civilians... That's what led to the bombing that turned Beloren into a wasteland!"],["Celine","Even today, neither side is willing to take responsibility for it."],["Rosemary","That's because the most crucial part of the incident was intentionally hidden."],["Rosemary","Why were there explosives of such great power in the city, and who detonated them?"],["Rosemary","Without this link, responsibility cannot be discussed."],["Natalia","\"Madam,\" there are still many outsiders in the room. Do you really wish to disclose such sensitive information here?"],["Rosemary","Concealment will not make conflicts disappear—it only brews more radical conspiracies in the shadows... Lando is proof of this."],["Rosemary","What I'm about to say... is the part deliberately concealed by Blair."],["Rosemary","What was detonated in Beloren City was not an ordinary bomb, but an arashi matter bomb commissioned by Blair and created by Lando."],["Rosemary","When the battle became unfavorable to him, Blair intentionally had the NDF lure the enemy deep into the city, drawing the DL forces inside... then detonated the explosives to annihilate the enemy's forces."],["Mary","So, that supposed accident... it was all a lie..."],["Rosemary","Yes, the arashi matter bomb is a weapon still in the experimental stage, and its power far exceeded everyone's expectations."],["Rosemary","In terms of the outcome, neither the warring parties nor Beloren... could escape the impact."],["Rosemary","Among the victims of that disaster were Lando's family."],["Celine","......"],["Rosemary","For this reason, Lando, who knows the truth behind all this, has a motive that cannot be ignored."],["Mary","Collaborating with Zeke, he is likely seeking revenge against the UNCS... a vendetta for his lost family, for everything."],["Cosette","Or perhaps... he just wants to atone for the sins he once committed."],["Cosette","After all, the explosives that destroyed the city were made by his own hands."],["Fregata","No matter what his true intentions are, our task remains the same—take him down along with Zeke."],["Fregata","Tell your machinists to hurry up! We don't have time to waste. As soon as the mech assembly's complete, we move out."],["Cosette","Hold on a moment... I request to withdraw from this mission."],["Fregata","Cosette, you're backing out now, at this critical moment... What are you thinking?!"],["","Cosette remains silent, answering with a cold stare."],["","In Fregata's memory, Cosette always quietly followed behind her and Madland. This is the first time she has seen such an expression on her face."],["","...Like someone who has experienced a long-awaited reunion, yet is determined to say goodbye."],["Madland","Fregata, don't press her."],["Madland","Did something happen, Cosette? If you're in trouble, just tell me."],["","Cosette's gaze wavers slightly, but she soon regains her former determination, as if she has made up her mind, and looks at Madland."],["Cosette","Boss... there's something I must do."],["Madland","...Then go ahead and do it. I won't stop you."],["Madland","Your mech took some big hits last run. Rest up and leave this fight to the grown-ups."],["Madland","When we get back, let's find a chance to talk. You can't keep leaving things wide open like this."],["Fregata","Speaking in half sentences and being all mysterious... isn't that just the result of a certain someone's influence?"],["Madland","*cough, cough...*"],["Cosette","I will, Boss..."]],"560907101":[["Madland","Be careful, we have now entered the city of Beloren... At this distance, we can already see Zeke's stronghold."],["Madland","Stay hidden and don't get spotted by their sentries."],["Celine","U-Understood, leave the reconnaissance work to me... I won't alert the enemy."],["Fregata","Celine, are you okay? You seem a bit distracted."],["Fregata","All this mess with Lando, it's been tough for you... If it's getting too much, take a breather."],["Celine","Don't worry, it's nothing like that. It's Dr. Lando... I think I've figure it out."],["Celine","He didn't reach this point on a whim. I imagine it was only after a great deal of struggle and conflict that he finally decided to do this..."],["Celine","So I won't run. I'll stop him with my own hands!"],["Madland","How about you, Captain Mary? Progress going smoothly?"],["Mary","I'm leading an NDF assault team, advancing along the highway into the city."],["Mary","According to the operation plan, we're right on schedule to reach their stronghold and close the pincer."],["Madland","Then I'll be waiting for the good news."],["Fregata","By the way, are you really planning to leave Cosette alone at the base?"],["Madland","Isn't it better this way? The farther she is from this dangerous situation, the better."],["Madland","Besides, she suggested it herself... I never like to force anyone against their will."],["Fregata","Hmph, forcing someone against their will... Can you recall even once when Cosette actively rejected a mission?"],["Fregata","Hasn't she always silently endured, pushing through as long as you don't relent, gritting her teeth until the very end?"],["Fregata","The Cosette I know would never say something like that."],["Madland","Right. Throughout this journey, Cosette has been acting quite out of character in a lot of ways. Could it be..."],["Madland","Is this what they call the teenage rebellion phase?"],["Fregata","What...? Okay, I'm out. Honestly, how did Cosette end up with a foster father this clueless?!"],["Madland","Woah, woah—save the yelling."],["Madland","Something's not right with Mary!"],["","Looking in the direction Madland points, she sees flashes of gunfire and smoke filling the air... a scene only found in a fierce battle."],["Madland","Captain Mary, tell me the situation! Have you encountered the enemy?"],["Mary","Damn it! The enemy set up an ambush here in advance! We're under heavy attack!"],["Mary","All remaining units, keep moving! Otherwise, you'll be... *ksshhh*"],["Madland","What the hell is going on?! Wasn't Celine supposed to keep an eye on their front? How did we walk into an ambush?"],["Celine","Sorry, the enemy appeared from a blind spot..."],["Celine","It's like they already knew our scouting habits and specifically targeted those spots..."],["Fregata","This is trouble. They hit our nerve. Madland, this operator knows your playbook."],["Madland","Damn it, it's Zeke!"],["Fregata","No, this time the enemy... knows you even better than he does."],["Fregata","Quickly, get everyone else back! I have a very bad feeling."],["Lando","The UNCS assault team has been completely pushed back."],["Lando","I must say... Professor Zeke, your assessment of their route was spot on, and the ambush operation went very smoothly."],["Zeke","Strictly speaking, it wasn't my assessment... but rather the judgment of that ace of mine."],["Zeke","But don't relax, go to the activation device first and warm up our precious machines... They'll be back fast."],["Lando","Is it necessary?"],["Lando","With their cover blown and losses high, even hardliners in the NDF will think twice."],["Zeke","Dr. Lando, you may know a bit about the NDF, but you don't understand Guan Yiwen as a person."],["Zeke","He's driven by emotion, and I once planted a hatred in him strong enough to last a lifetime."],["Zeke","As long as he catches my scent, even if he's isolated and alone... he will charge forward without hesitation to complete his revenge."],["Lando","Hmph, sounds a lot like those lunatics from the Revival Front."],["Zeke","There's a fine line between madness and bravery... and Guan Yiwen treads it like a tightrope artist."],["Zeke","That's why I want to completely crush him."],["Zeke","Simply killing him is far from enough! I want to twist everything about him and then reshape him until he becomes my ideal form."],["","Quiet. No one's interested in your mad scientist monologue."],["","Rest time is over... They've already arrived."],["Lando","That's your ace? She's not even acknowledging your existence."],["Zeke","It's okay, I never cared about those formalities anyway."],["Zeke","All you need to know is that she, like you, is a fellow traveler who wants to change the past and make up for regrets."]],"560907301":[["","Almost the instant she sees those eerie eyes, her consciousness erupts and dissipates, senses submerged in a sea of primordial data in the blink of an eye."],["","The sky fades, the earth sinks. No companions in sight, nor enemies."],["","All that her senses perceive is a long river composed of data and code."],["Cosette","Boss..."],["","Finally, in that deep darkness, a glimmer of light emerges."],["","That familiar figure has long been sitting quietly by the side, waiting for her."],["Madland","I didn't expect you to block Fregata at that position... Had I known, I would have held back a few more tricks."],["Madland","You won, Cosette. It was a beautiful fight."],["Cosette","Boss, from the beginning, there was never any winning or losing..."],["Cosette","My goal was never to defeat you... Even if I won, there's nothing to be happy about."],["Madland","Then why are you working with Zeke Steel?"],["Madland","All that talk of fate and salvation... I thought you'd gone as loopy as him. Trust me: mad scientist isn't the gig for a girl like you."],["","Unintentionally, a hint of nostalgia crosses Cosette's face, which she herself doesn't even notice."],["Cosette","Still the same old you, Boss—bad jokes at the worst time."],["Cosette","Boss, I'm not the person you know... I'm a Cosette from a distant future you've never seen."],["Cosette","In that cold future, you gave your life, and Fregata left soon after, leaving me to support Donau alone."],["Madland","Just to be safe, let me ask one thing..."],["Madland","The one who took me down wasn't that bastard Zeke, was it?"],["Cosette","Of course not... It was someone even more cunning and dangerous than him."],["Madland","Phew, that's a relief... As long as it wasn't at his hands."],["Cosette","......"],["","As if something has touched her, a layer of clouds suddenly covers Cosette's face."],["","She lifts her head, her eyes glimmering... the expression of anger about to burst."],["Cosette","There it is again! Every time, it's the same indifferent look!"],["Cosette","Have you never thought about us... never thought about what will happen to Donau after your death?!"],["Cosette","After you leave, the people you care about, the things you care about, everything will come to an abrupt halt as if the power's been cut off!"],["Cosette","Even knowing this, do you still not care?!"],["Madland","Of course I care, and I'm not willing to leave this world with regrets..."],["Madland","But I won't, for my own selfish reasons, choose to cooperate with scum like Zeke Steel and then up and abandon my friends in such a bizarre place."],["Cosette","No, it's not that bizarre... We're currently in a space constructed by the BIRD/BINARY System."],["Madland","Is this the black technology Zeke tinkered with using the arashi matter on the island?"],["Cosette","That's right... and it can do far more than just project Hologram STs."],["Cosette","The BIRD/BINARY System objectively records everything from the past, and by making adjustments based on these records, it can calculate an entirely new future."],["Cosette","With it, we can truly change the past and alter the timeline where you are destined to die."],["Madland","But what if I don't want you to do that?"],["Cosette","......"],["","As the words fall, a river of data begins to flood the entire space, and the scenery before them stretches and trembles."],["","Cosette's figure becomes like a kite with a broken string, drifting into the distance."],["Cosette","Time's up, Boss."],["Madland","Don't think about escaping! Answer my question, Cosette!"],["Cosette","Don't worry, I'm not the only one who wants to change the past by working with Zeke."],["Cosette","We will meet again in Beloren..."],["Cosette","I'll give you my answer in my own way... Boss."],["","Cosette turns around... and then resolutely walks into the river of data, disappearing within it."]],"560908101":[["Madland","Cosette..."],["","When Madland regains consciousness, the space calculated by the BIRD/BINARY system is no longer before him."],["","Instead, he sees a charcoal night sky."],["Fregata","Madland, what are you doing lying there? Now's not the time to goof off!"],["Fregata","Snap out of it! If you don't want to be blown sky-high by the next shell, then—get out of the way!"],["","The sound of explosions from the falling artillery echoes in Madland's ears, and only then does he notice that the ground he had just been standing on is now scorched black."],["Madland","What the hell is this place...?"],["","His heart races, blood surging; his instincts honed on the battlefield gradually take over, pulling him back to reality."],["","Madland only then notices that the sky above is already filled with smoke and fire... a scene of devastation only found on a battlefield."],["Fregata","Who knows where this is? I only remember Zeke activating that mech, then there was a sudden flash... and when I came to, I was here."],["Fregata","Shells everywhere... feels like we got tossed into a goddamn trench!"],["Madland","I think... your guess must be at least half right."],["Madland","We're... I'm afraid we're right on the front line of the Battle of Beloren, over a decade ago."],["","Seizing the lull in the bombardment, Madland recounts everything he just encountered to everyone in the most concise language."],["Mary","Though it's difficult to believe, I have to agree with Mr. Madland's hypothesis..."],["Mary","The combat STs here, these long-obsolete models—they're carrying numbers from the border war era."],["Mary","But if this is Beloren from over a decade ago... then it all makes sense."],["Celine","This place... is the Beloren of my childhood..."],["Celine","I still remember that building to the east... Every time my family took me out, I would always hide in its shadow to avoid the sun..."],["Celine","I never expected... we would actually arrive on the night of the Battle of Beloren... If that's the case, could it be that my father is..."],["Fregata","First a new world, now time travel. I think I can finally say I've seen everything."],["Fregata","So what do we do now? With these gunports everywhere... I can't see any sign of Zeke or Cosette."],["Madland","There's a third lead besides them—Lando."],["Madland","Cosette said, \"I'm not the only one who wants to change the past by working with Zeke.\""],["Madland","Celine, remember what the UNCS official said about Beloren's destruction?"],["Celine","Dr. Lando... his arashi matter bomb... destroyed the city..."],["Celine","Indeed, the current time is just before Beloren was destroyed... This is probably a deliberate choice by Dr. Lando, selecting this specific point in time."],["Celine","The reason he did this was to try to rectify his past mistakes and stop the detonation of the arashi matter bomb..."],["Madland","That's what I needed to know. Our target's clear."],["Madland","Head to the laboratory and find Dr. Lando."],["Madland","That bastard Zeke is probably there!"]],"560908301":[["","Following Celine's ST positioning radar, Fregata sees nothing but flames and ashes along the way."],["","She can feel it... The city marching steadily and swiftly toward destruction."],["","After taking down two relentless STs, Fregata finally catches sight of Celine leaning against cover, battered and bruised, like a bird with broken wings."],["Fregata","Hey, intel broker—if I remember correctly, our contract didn't include \"acting as bait.\""],["Fregata","In a rush to play hero? Don't want your final payment, huh?"],["Celine","Sorry... I acted impulsively..."],["Fregata","Never mind... Is this your first time on a battlefield like this?"],["Celine","Yeah. Enemies left and right—my body can't stop shaking... and to think this is all because of Dr. Lando..."],["Celine","I feel like I have to do something to make up for all this..."],["Fregata","First-timers on the battlefield always get hot-headed and lose the plot."],["Fregata","I know Lando's mess is chewing you up, and this war in your hometown has you on edge..."],["Fregata","But remember, the more critical the moment, the more you need to stay calm! Acting on impulse will only complicate the situation."],["Celine","......"],["Celine","I'm sorry. I'll be more thoughtful next time..."],["Fregata","Alright, stop blaming yourself."],["Fregata","We don't have time for guilt—this Lando business isn't over yet."],["Fregata","If you really feel bad, just give us a discount on the intel fee... I noticed Chloe's eyelids twitch when she heard the quote."],["","Just as the two are about to depart, the low hum of an ST engine suddenly sounds nearby."],["DL Captain","The hit on the radar is right over here—everyone, on me!"],["DL Soldier","We must avenge the warriors of the third squad! Don't let any of these stragglers escape!"],["Fregata","Tch, finishing off one batch after another... These guys don't quit."],["","Almost the moment the enemy launches their attack, Fregata immediately reacts and slides to perfect range."],["","But just before she can pull the trigger, a flame-like orange light illuminates the darkness ahead of her."],["","Even as the DL signals disappear one by one, Fregata keeps her weapon up, sights pinned on the thinning smoke."],["Fregata","Stop hiding and come out!"],["Fregata","I know you're there."],["???","Please don't shoot, I mean no harm!"],["Fregata","Is that... a UNCS emblem?!"],["Fregata","You knew we were an unidentified third party—and didn't open fire?"],["???","I'm UNCS, but it doesn't mean I stand with the NDF."],["???","I saw that your identification signal didn't belong to any side, so I thought you were residents fleeing in a civilian ST. That's why I came over."],["Fregata","So the NDF still has a few sane heads left."],["Security Chief Dustin","Let me introduce myself. I'm Security Chief Dustin of the Beloren Experiment Center."],["Security Chief Dustin","For special reasons, I'm also being hunted by the NDF, and the DL considers me an enemy..."],["Security Chief Dustin","Like you, I am a third party, not welcomed by either side."],["Celine","Dustin... How is that possible...?"],["Fregata","Celine, is there something wrong? You look... upset."],["Fregata","Wait, he's lying?!"],["Celine","No, everything he said is true..."],["Celine","Dustin... is my father's name."]],"560909101":[["Security Chief Dustin","You already know about Lando's side deal with the UNCS?!"],["Security Chief Dustin","No wonder you chose this direct route to the Experiment Center..."],["Security Chief Dustin","But... the arashi matter bomb is top-secret. How did you get this information...?"],["Fregata","W-Well..."],["Security Chief Dustin","And your ST is pretty advanced."],["Security Chief Dustin","In terms of design, they rival the prototypes in the Experiment Center."],["Security Chief Dustin","Are you... really just an ordinary GSA operative?"],["","Fregata looks to Celine for answers, but Celine just shakes her head helplessly."],["Security Chief Dustin","Forget it, since you know secrets that deep, your superiors probably have extremely high clearance..."],["Security Chief Dustin","I get why you can't answer."],["Fregata","Phew, that's right... We share the same goal—we're all here to stop Lando."],["Celine","In that case, Dustin, would you like to join us?"],["Celine","It's a warzone out there. Going solo is suicide."],["Security Chief Dustin","Don't worry, I have an alternative route secured. It'll take us straight to the Experiment Center."],["Security Chief Dustin","But after that, we'll have to part ways... There's something even more urgent I need to do."],["Celine","More urgent than stopping Dr. Lando?"],["Security Chief Dustin","Yes... I need to dismantle the fuses and explosives they've set up in the residential area."],["Security Chief Dustin","The arashi matter bomb is a special demolition device that uses arashi matter to trigger a chain explosion... To successfully complete the detonation, fuses and secondary explosives need to be placed throughout the city."],["Security Chief Dustin","Those maniacs at the NDF... For what they call victory, they'd turn the entire city into fodder for their war machine!"],["Security Chief Dustin","My wife and daughter are still in the city... Even if it costs me my life, I have to dismantle those bombs!"],["Celine","So... the reason the residential area survived wasn't just a coincidence..."],["Fregata","Calling out your own side takes guts. No wonder the UNCS hates you."],["Fregata","However, as long as we seize the research center, those explosives won't pose a threat, right? You sure you're not coming?"],["Security Chief Dustin","No. All the arashi matter bombs have independent fuses. Even if you control the research center, there's no guarantee those politicians won't flip the switch for their own best interests..."],["Security Chief Dustin","I won't gamble with the lives of my family—or the millions of people in Beloren."],["","After saying this, Dustin activates his ST and moves out."],["Fregata","Your old man doesn't seem as bad as you made him out to be."],["Fregata","...Are you really not going to tell him who you are?"],["Celine","I don't know..."],["Celine","\"The fierce blast completely destroyed Beloren, with only the residential area miraculously spared.\""],["Celine","I always thought it was a coincidence... I never expected the reason I survived was all because my father stood up that night."],["Celine","All along, I blamed him for my mother's death and the pain of my childhood, but in the end..."],["Celine","I... what should I do...?"],["","Fregata sighs and helplessly rubs her forehead."],["Fregata","Celine, he's your dad... I don't get to call this."],["Fregata","I can only tell you one thing—don't do something you'll regret."],["Fregata","...Don't be like Cosette, trapped in the past and unable to move forward."],["Celine","......"]],"560909301":[["Security Chief Dustin","With this, all the fuses have been dealt with."],["Security Chief Dustin","Thank you again. If it weren't for you, I would never have been able to handle these engineers..."],["Fregata","Can your mech still move? Do you really not need our help?"],["Security Chief Dustin","Yeah, I've prepared plenty of spare parts here. Just need to fix it up."],["Security Chief Dustin","Let's part ways here... I can handle the rest on my own."],["Celine","......"],["Celine","No, I'm staying."],["Celine","Wandering around the battlefield in an ST that could break down at any moment is tantamount to suicide... I can't just stand by and watch you throw your life away!"],["Fregata","Wait, you..."],["Security Chief Dustin","What do you mean?! You're GSA operatives, and Dr. Lando and Blair's agents are still in the research center!"],["Security Chief Dustin","The entire city and millions of lives could be extinguished at any moment!"],["Security Chief Dustin","You... have an even greater mission on your shoulders. Stop Dr. Lando, don't waste time on me..."],["","Fregata's gaze wanders between the two of them... She can tell that neither side has any intention of backing down."],["","She frowns... For some reason, she thinks of the father and daughter who had once given her such a headache."],["Fregata","No. I'm the only actual GSA agent here."],["Fregata","She... is just a civilian assisting me with the investigation, like you, a resident of Beloren."],["Celine","Fregata..."],["Fregata","I told you, this is your personal business... No matter what choice you make, I'll respect it."],["Security Chief Dustin","Then... I definitely can't let her come with me."],["Celine","Why? One more body means one more shot at living..."],["Celine","Are you really planning to face all this alone?!"],["Security Chief Dustin","Listen, I'm an adult—this war is our mess. Dragging a child like you into it would be unforgivable."],["Security Chief Dustin","You're from Beloren too. Somewhere out there, your family's waiting for you."],["Celine","Yes. He's right here..."],["Security Chief Dustin","Then go back, return to your family, and tell them you're safe... They must still be waiting for you."],["Celine","What about you? Doesn't your family matter?"],["Celine","They're waiting for you too..."],["Security Chief Dustin","I'm not only a father—I'm also a soldier... Besides my family, I have my own mission."],["Security Chief Dustin","I don't want Beloren to become a tool for schemers to conduct their military misadventures, but that doesn't mean I will allow the DLAF to invade this city!"],["Security Chief Dustin","What comes next... is my war. You don't have to see it through with me."],["","In the girl's eyes, there is first confusion, then sadness... Finally, Celine seems to make up her mind, pressing her lips tightly together."],["Celine","I understand, then let's say our goodbyes here."],["Fregata","Celine..."],["Celine","Let's go. I've made up my mind... No matter what happens, I won't regret it."],["Celine","He's right, we have our own war to fight... A mission that only we can complete."],["","Before parting, Celine turns slightly, looking once more at that familiar yet strange person."],["Celine","But remember—you're still a father."],["Celine","Don't die easily. Do everything you can to stay alive... and watch your child grow up with your own eyes."],["Security Chief Dustin","...I will."],["","Dustin watches, quietly seeing the two of them off."],["","But for some reason, after their figures vanish over the horizon, he feels a sense of loss."],["Security Chief Dustin","Strange. I'd never met her before..."],["Security Chief Dustin","But why... do I feel this indescribable sense of familiarity...?"]],"560995101":[["","Meanwhile, at the Beloren Research Center..."],["Blair Commissioner","Are you out of your mind?! How dare you refuse to cooperate with us!"],["Blair Commissioner","The NDF are right outside... Drink the toast or swallow the penalty—we'll force you if we have to."],["Lando","Then go ahead. Before officially notifying you, I already ordered the detonation lines of all arashi matter explosives in the Experiment Center to be cut."],["Blair Commissioner","You will regret this... Hey, Captain, the negotiations have broken down. Send someone in immediately to take over the Experiment Center!"],["UNCS Captain","Sir, the garrison outside the Experiment Center is under heavy attack by a large number of STs! We are engaged in fierce combat!"],["UNCS Captain","Wait, how are they coming from the Experiment Center, and why do they have DLAF ST models?! What the... Whoa!"],["Blair Commissioner","What's going on? Answer me, Captain!"],["","The only response to the commissioner's question is the dead silence from the communicator."],["Blair Commissioner","H-How is this possible...? The main forces of the NDF should have already been deployed to the front lines. How did you conjure up these troops?!"],["Lando","...You don't need to know."],["","Lando seems to have anticipated this moment. He draws his pistol, disengages the safety, and aims it at the now panicked commissioner."],["Lando","Any last words?"],["Blair Commissioner","Wait, wait! We can still talk, Dr. Lando, don't get excited, we can still..."],["","The incessant chatter is abruptly cut off by a dull gunshot."],["Lando","Alright, everyone else, get back to your posts and do what you're supposed to."],["Laboratory Guard","R-Report, Dr. Lando! The STs and equipment you brought have been integrated into the Experiment Center and are ready for use at any time."],["Laboratory Guard","In addition, the field personnel have brought your family back from the city to the Experiment Center, but they seem confused, saying that you, sir... have aged beyond recognition."],["Lando","Let them rest. Just say... never mind, I'll go and tell them myself later."],["Laboratory Guard","What about the security chief? Since Dustin left the Experiment Center, we haven't been able to contact him."],["Lando","Don't worry about him... I will now take full charge of the security work at the Experiment Center."],["","Under Lando's command, the once chaotic experiment center quickly returns to its former order... while the frenzied figure beside him seems increasingly out of place."],["Zeke","Impressive, truly impressive... Such a ruthless and decisive move."],["Zeke","How does it feel to have avenged your great grudge, Dr. Lando?"],["Lando","I feel nothing... I've already said, my cooperation with you is not out of revenge... but to make amends for past mistakes."],["Zeke","I didn't expect you to really be so haunted by past mistakes... I thought you were hiding something more interesting, like a conspiracy."],["Lando","Professor Zeke, to outsiders it may seem like a mistake... but to me, it's everything I regret."],["Lando","Back then, I was confident, believing I could be a scientist on par with Winston and Cicero, unwilling to remain just a small researcher in Beloren."],["Lando","But ambition without support is nothing more than empty talk. The long wait made me increasingly anxious and uneasy, and I began to crave chaos and opportunity..."],["Zeke","And the Beloren War gave you this opportunity."],["Lando","That's right... At that time, when Blair extended an olive branch, the first thing I felt was neither confusion nor fear... but excitement."],["Lando","\"The opportunity to realize my ambitions has finally arrived! I'll surely make a name for myself with the help of the arashi matter bomb!\""],["Lando","...For such a naive idea, I even went so far as to break ties with Celine's father."],["Zeke","You made the right choice. For such a trivial cost, you gained a status that other researchers could never achieve in their lifetime."],["Lando","It wasn't trivial! An entire city, all my family and friends... I destroyed them with my own hands!"],["Lando","Ironically, the secrets within me are tightly bound to the NDF... No one dares expose me, and no one can judge me..."],["Lando","Adopting orphans, charity funds, medical endeavors... I've thought of many ways to atone, but these honors have not brought me peace. Instead, they have made my inner struggle even greater."],["Lando","Every time I close my eyes, I dream of that chaotic night... Finally, I have a chance to change it..."],["Zeke","What a pity, what a pity indeed... This is the true limitation of you ordinary people! Foolish, ignorant, and short-sighted."],["Zeke","Even though you deceived everyone, in the end, you couldn't fool yourself."],["Zeke","But... have you thought about what comes next?"],["Zeke","You can't rely on these Hologram STs to guard this place for a lifetime, can you?"],["Lando","...Whether it's through negotiation or threats, I will do everything I can to secure a place for me and my family."],["Lando","As long as there is the BIRD/BINARY System, it can be done... If not, then I'll try again! Yes, there will always be a way!"],["Cosette","Enough... You're not the only one who needs the BIRD/BINARY System."],["","The voice comes from a dim corner, where a girl's figure almost blends with the shadows. Her gaze is as sharp as a knife, fixed intently in his direction."],["Lando","What's that look on your face? Do you have any idea how much I've sacrificed for Professor Steel's research? How could a newcomer like you possibly understand?!"],["Zeke","Dr. Lando, we're all on the same team, there's no need to be so tense."],["Zeke","Relax, relax... Leave this to me."],["","Lando waves his hand and turns away, entering the lab center with the other staff."],["Cosette","Such big words... In reality, you just see him as a tool, don't you?"],["Cosette","Using his connections and resources to help you establish yourself on this island, to realize your elusive visions..."],["Cosette","From the moment the BIRD/BINARY System was implemented, he had no more value to you."],["Zeke","Hahaha, you really are the protégé of Guan Yiwen."],["Zeke","Adopted or not, you're becoming more like him by the day—just as sharp as he is."],["Zeke","Speaking of which, Mr. Guan hasn't given me a shred of trust..."],["Zeke","And yet you can shelve your friend's murder and sit at my table. Not afraid I'll bury a knife in your back?"],["Cosette","You won't do that."],["Cosette","I know you... You're pragmatic to the point of sadism. Betrayal, madness—to you they're just means to an end."],["Cosette","As long as I still have value to you, you won't do anything to me."],["Cosette","As for Bernini, in my timeline... I've already avenged her with my own hands."],["Cosette","...Killing you again would only make me feel sick."],["Zeke","No wonder... No wonder! I was wondering why I couldn't see any hatred in your eyes, and now it all makes sense!"],["Zeke","Then could you tell me... in your future, how exactly did I die at your hands?"],["Zeke","Did I die heroically and fearlessly, like a warrior? Or did I exhaust all my schemes and leave unwillingly in the end? Or perhaps... was I just taken out without knowing why?"],["Cosette","...You wish."],["Cosette","Your final moments were pathetic and absurd, dying like a ridiculous clown, utterly hideous to the end."],["Zeke","You must be telling the truth... That's exactly how I imagined my ideal death!"],["","Cosette's lips twitch slightly, a hint of uncontrollable disgust flashing in her eyes."],["Cosette","Knowing how you die, you still won't change?"],["Zeke","Of course... Since you understand my true intentions, you should also understand my logic."],["Zeke","Mr. Guan Yiwen is like raw jade. Only through intense grinding and hammering can he inherit his true will... That's why I have set so many trials for him!"],["Zeke","If these trials require my life... then just take it!"],["Cosette","Then never mind what I said before... you're simply insane."],["Zeke","Thank you... That's the best compliment I could hope for."],["Laboratory Guard","Professor Steel, the control room has issued an emergency notice—the Experiment Center has been breached!"],["Zeke","Oh? There are actually some fools left who still don't know their place. Tell me, who are they?"],["Laboratory Guard","We cannot identify the intruders. Their identity signals do not belong to any faction! All we know is that there are only two of them!"],["Cosette","Boss... They've arrived."],["Zeke","Then... let's complete the final step of this trial together."],["Zeke","You return to the past you wish to change... and I will go to the future I wish to embrace."]],"560910101":[["","From the moment Madland and Mary step through the gate, an endless chase begins."],["","Hologram STs emerging from the ND projector trample over the remains and debris of their predecessors, surging forward like a pack of beasts."],["Madland","Still can't reach Fregata and Celine?"],["Mary","Right—the Beloren battlespace is jammed. We can't get a clean link."],["Madland","Then we move now. If we wait, we'll end up boxed in."],["Mary","Got it."],["","As soon as these words are spoken, their thrusters blaze like a comet's tail, and their machines flash through the corridors of the Experiment Center."],["","The sound of bullets, gunports, missiles... Weapons and the shadows of STs recede like a tide."],["","No one can stop them... except her."],["Cosette","You really came... Boss."],["Cosette","You're still the same as before, never willing to let yourself off the hook."],["Cosette","As long as it's something you think you need to do, even if it's a mountain of knives and a sea of fire... you'll charge in without hesitation."],["Madland","And what about you, Cosette? After all these years, how did you become so timid?"],["Cosette","Even now you won't believe me, Boss?"],["Cosette","Look around us... ND technology is real, and it has the power to change fate."],["Cosette","I don't intend to make sweeping changes to the past like Lando. I just hope.... that you can survive. I want you to have a second chance, Boss... that's all."],["Madland","......"],["Madland","Cosette, calm down and listen to me."],["Madland","First, you've underestimated Zeke. While you're using him, he's also using you."],["Madland","Second, what you're doing now isn't changing fate—it's running from it."],["Cosette","Running? Says the man who treats death like an exit. Spare me."],["Cosette","Stop trying to comfort me like I'm a child, Boss!"],["Cosette","You don't know what I've lived through! You haven't experienced the despair I've faced!"],["","Madland doesn't interrupt her, but waits with patience for Cosette to finish... He sighs softly, as if recalling some distant past."],["Madland","On the contrary, it's precisely because I've been through these things... I understand how naive it is to talk about changing fate."],["Madland","Of course, you can use these bizarre machines to shape the past into whatever you desire."],["Madland","But what about next time?"],["Cosette","There won't be a next time..."],["Cosette","I'll destroy the device myself once it's done. I promise."],["Madland","There will be a next time. When you face separation, pain, and tragedy again, you'll reach for it once more."],["Madland","And you'll drop duty and this promise to rewrite the past—again."],["Cosette","......"],["Cosette","...I knew I couldn't persuade you, Boss."],["","Cosette's voice turns cold, and the very moment the last note fades, she swiftly swings her weapon, striking at the ST in front of her."],["","Madland seems to have anticipated it, retreating along the blade's arc—the deadly strike leaving only a shallow scratch on his chassis."],["Madland","Hmph, I don't recall teaching you to sucker punch."],["Cosette","It's something I learned myself... during your absence."]],"560910301":[["Madland","Cosette, come out of the ST... the holograms have disappeared."],["Cosette","......"],["Madland","I'll say it now—from the future or not, what you did can't be wiped clean with just an apology."],["Madland","However, I still welcome you back... Cosette, no matter what you've been through, sit with me and Freg and talk it out."],["Cosette","...Let's talk, Boss."],["Cosette","My body... has already started to disintegrate."],["Madland","Disintegrate?! Did Zeke do something to you?!"],["Cosette","No, this was my own choice."],["Cosette","The BIRD/BINARY System is built on a special high-dimensional network... To manually shut it down, merging the physical body is the only way."],["Cosette","There's... no turning back now."],["Madland","......"],["Cosette","Boss, may I ask you a question?"],["Madland","Go ahead..."],["Cosette","I don't understand... Why do you refuse to change the past—every time?"],["Cosette","Just a slight change could lead to a completely different outcome..."],["Madland","Because the past... isn't something you can just discard."],["Madland","Cosette, do you remember where we met?"],["Cosette","Of course I remember."],["Cosette","It was in Winterland, you ended up on the island due to the Reinhardt incident... and then you met me, also in a mess."],["Madland","Yeah. In that disaster I burned my life's work and watched the person I loved die before my eyes..."],["Madland","If I could really change the past, I would never have become a scientist at Titan Industries in the first place."],["Madland","Might as well be a mecha anime otaku, burning through the days in some Ophi City apartment..."],["Cosette","Heh... I can't imagine you doing something like that."],["Madland","Right? I can't imagine it either. Because if that were the case, I wouldn't have met you, Fregata, and everyone at Donau."],["Madland","Bitter as it is, my past is what makes me."],["Madland","If I were to abandon all this, \"I\" probably wouldn't exist anymore."],["Cosette","......"],["Cosette","I understand..."],["","A stream of data composed of countless codes flows out from the ST, enveloping the entire space like a curtain... It is the precursor to a time jump."],["Madland","Cosette, what are you doing?!"],["Cosette","I'm here to send you back... back to Milkhama."],["Cosette","There are still remnants of Zeke's experimental equipment there. With the help of that laboratory, you can return to your original time."],["Fregata","Cosette, what about you?"],["Fregata","You want us to leave you? Let's get out here—come back with us."],["Cosette","I'm sorry, Fregata..."],["Cosette","I'm not strong like the boss. I can't face that kind of reality."],["Cosette","Boss, do you remember the question you asked me?"],["Madland","If I'll drop my duty and my promise to rewrite the past again?"],["Cosette","I will."],["Cosette","Next time, and the time after that too."],["Cosette","Even if I have to abandon my own past, I must change that ending..."],["","Gradually, the girl's voice and figure, like the flowing code, begins to blur."],["","Like a sand painting carefully pieced together, it disappears with just a gentle blow."],["Madland","No, you have already changed the future... Cosette."],["Madland","If that moment truly arrives, this time, I will give it my all... and struggle just a bit more."],["","Hearing Madland's words, the outline pieced together by code trembles slightly, trying hard to squeeze out a smile."],["","Like dust, it shines and then dissipates."]],"560996101":[["","According to the latest investigation by our reporter, the frequent abnormal phenomena around Beloren have now almost disappeared completely."],["","Experts from the Institute of Technology have stated that these anomalies might be mirages caused by extreme weather. Citizens are advised to exercise caution and not be influenced by careless rumors."],["","Meanwhile, the UNCS also disclosed yesterday the details of the \"Battle of Beloren\" that shocked Milkhama more than a decade ago."],["","After extensive investigation and research, officials confirmed that the true cause of the bombing in Beloren was a new type of explosive planted within the city."],["","The spokesperson also revealed that the creator of the new explosive was a renowned scientist in the academic world, Dr. Lando."],["","There is evidence that he was secretly collaborating with former Governor Blair during the border wars and is the main suspect in the detonation of explosives within the city."],["","However, as of now, Dr. Lando's whereabouts remain a mystery. UNCS authorities have issued a wanted notice, vowing to thoroughly investigate the truth. If any of our viewers have any information, please contact us at any time."],["","We will continue to follow the developments of this incident and bring you the latest reports."],["","Next up, an urgent message concerning the Dawnstar League..."],["Mary","So in the end... this is how Beloren's secret history came to light."],["Mary","Shifting all the contradictions and responsibilities onto two people who can no longer speak... Quite a clever tactic."],["Celine","No. It's good enough."],["Celine","This is probably... the result Dr. Lando wanted."],["","The girl sighs softly, gently brushing the dust off the tombstone, and quietly places her carefully-chosen bouquet in front of the grave."],["","\"Dedicated to a brave soldier and a great father\"—this was the first time Celine clearly saw the epitaph on her father's tombstone."],["Celine","As expected... everything that happened that night belonged to another timeline."],["Celine","I wonder if the mother and father from that time survived that catastrophe."],["Fregata","Don't think too much... especially about things no one can control."],["","Fregata pats Celine on the shoulder and places the drink in her hands in front of the tombstone."],["Fregata","Just remember, your old man didn't let you down."],["Celine","Thank you... Thanks to you, I was able to meet my father..."],["Celine","I know now that he didn't abandon my mother and I... but made the right choice."],["Celine","*sigh* ...This trip's one I won't forget anytime soon."],["Fregata","Heh, I'm not sure I agree."],["Fregata","You've got a long life ahead of you, with a bunch of trouble waiting in the wings... so just be prepared."],["Celine","Speaking of which... are you already heading back?"],["Madland","That's right, thanks to Captain Mary's detailed report, the higher-ups have given us quite a few green lights."],["Madland","I heard the reverse engineering over there is almost done. Looks like in a few days we'll be heading back."],["Fregata","Wait, Madland, are we just gonna leave like this?"],["Fregata","What about the Cosette situation?"],["Mary","Unfortunately, the tech department tried all they could... but they didn't find any trace of your friend."],["Mary","I'm afraid she..."],["Madland","Don't overcomplicate it. Just call it a dream."],["Madland","After all, what we saw was Cosette from a future timeline. The Cosette in our world... is probably still lying in a hospital bed."],["Madland","If we let her endure all this... Well, she doesn't deserve that weight."],["Fregata","......"],["Madland","Enough heavy talk—Officer Mary, how about that ST combat class you mentioned?"],["Mary","I've already spoken to the military academy, and they're ready to host you anytime."],["Fregata","Wait a minute... Military academy? Classes...? What exactly are you up to?"],["Madland","Oh, nothing much. Captain Mary thinks I can really throw down. She wants me to show the rookies a few tricks."],["Madland","What's the word...? Oh right, guest instructor!"],["Fregata","So that's it, Madland, ditching work to make some extra cash on the side, huh?"],["Madland","Well, I'm just killing time anyway. Since I'm here, might as well leave something behind... How about you join me for a few rounds?"],["Fregata","Alright, bring it on!"],["Fregata","But when you lose, don't get sore about me embarrassing you."]]};
